 refunding.\n- Updated `AllRoundsTable` and `MyBetsTable` to include action buttons for each round.\n- Implemented refund logic in the API and added corresponding hooks for mutation.\n- Enhanced user feedback with toast notifications for spin and refund actions.\n- Added translations for new action messages in the English language file.","tree":{"sha":"c9dcd29a8b78bfe5e503de2c319e18641018e28b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/betfinio/stones/git/trees/c9dcd29a8b78bfe5e503de2c319e18641018e28b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/betfinio/stones/git/commits/0a526a4fd2aa911fb420e500e36b5cc4212e7c05","verification":{"payload":"tree c9dcd29a8b78bfe5e503de2c319e18641018e28b\nparent ecb15e23a1000795dd5fff020f144f6eab91ff5b\nauthor Plane <bf.plane@proton.me> 1775489689 +0200\ncommitter Plane <bf.plane@proton.me> 1775489689 +0200\n\nfeat: add round actions functionality to betting tables\n\n- Introduced a new `RoundActions` component for managing round actions such as spinning and refunding.\n- Updated `AllRoundsTable` and `MyBetsTable` to include action buttons for each round.\n- Implemented refund logic in the API and added corresponding hooks for mutation.\n- Enhanced user feedback with toast notifications for spin and refund actions.\n- Added translations for new action messages in the English language file.\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW3oABjICTWPKZXVu2Rwr6XDSae\naEXpTyE0vHjmPnNqIAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCNiG5/fgozO4EJkJQUnEaHHuTAN4Zhc5xRCJpEF5scpRzRUxG8PWdpc1W0YvGErR8\ntpussfs/fsEFgPKC3nhAw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175963220?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-plane/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-plane/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bf-plane/following{/other_user