users/bvandewe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bvandewe","id":10199148,"login":"bvandewe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTk5MTQ4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bvandewe","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bvandewe/events-player/commits/33e13daaac13396e635bba9cbd571a2e1f453b88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-02T09:23:06Z","email":"bvandewe@gmail.com","name":"Bruno van de Werve"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-02T09:23:06Z","email":"bvandewe@gmail.com","name":"Bruno van de Werve"},"message":"refactor: restructure dashboard/timeline into component modules\n\n- Create modular component architecture for better maintainability\n- Split monolithic dashboard.js (822 lines) into focused components\n- Streamline timeline.js (1059→481 lines) removing redundant code\n\nNew component structure:\n- main.js (260 lines) - Lightweight orchestrator\n- components/metrics.js (269 lines) - Metrics cards controller\n- components/storage.js (117 lines) - Storage indicators\n- components/analytics.js (293 lines) - Chart.js analytics\n- components/timeline.js (481 lines) - Timeline chart (streamlined)\n\nBenefits:\n- Clear separation of concerns (each component = one responsibility)\n- Smaller, testable, portable modules\n- No redundant initialization or imports\n- Better code organization and onboarding\n- 25% total line reduction with improved structure\n\nAll functionality preserved - backward compatible","tree":{"sha":"c661a143738272127943a16af8a95a9cd71b9476","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bvandewe/events-player/git/trees/c661a143738272127943a16af8a95a9cd71b9476"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bvandewe/events-player/git/commits/33e13daaac13396e635bba9cbd571a2e1f453b88","verification":{"payload":"tree c661a143738272127943a16af8a95a9cd71b9476\nparent 3560e7290cf4e61b680bf84e2bd465bf8c6f631c\nauthor Bruno van de Werve <bvandewe@gmail.com> 1762075386 +0100\ncommitter Bruno van de Werve <bvandewe@gmail.com> 1762075386 +0100\n\nrefactor: restructure dashboard/timeline into component modules\n\n- Create modular component architecture for better maintainability\n- Split monolithic dashboard.js (822 lines) into focused components\n- Streamline timeline.js (1059→481 lines) removing redundant code\n\nNew component structure:\n- main.js (260 lines) - Lightweight orchestrator\n- components/metrics.js (269 lines) - Metrics cards controller\n- components/storage.js (117 lines) - Storage indicators\n- components/analytics.js (293 lines) - Chart.js analytics\n- components/timeline.js (481 lines) - Timeline chart (streamlined)\n\nBenefits:\n- Clear separation of concerns (each component = one responsibility)\n- Smaller, testable, portable modules\n- No redundant initialization or imports\n- Better code organization and onboarding\n- 25% total line reduction with improved structure\n\nAll functionality preserved - backward compatible\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCAAdFiEEGqCrV5L5BdU77QXpOwq7hpFy/28FAmkHIvoACgkQOwq7hpFy\n/289YA/+KLWB1YGMauKo4RgX8Naj4VKscVVF2XmdmeKCLtyEFPSMaLV17GxHVU7O\niXKokgYE7dGkgaVgV7Uz2UUyOEVKObFDBE8PnyG+qtY2l1uYuCxtb19pmzLWlVo9\n1P5CYXrXYSI+LiXOJi6r8n8/cdaFOjPJEAmM1PcoEfS9cyrpuZETVmr5t2F0kYoI\npsrCDEPuBcmTtNN/OJFoTZU4npQDyhCJqsOwezRRH7lLW+Sf2Q1Rbp6L4aA+FwzH\naBFJcLMgx7o0GiAj4RzD60nwRCRePRQCNGG9McvvYjqdIcfdNbBQHrdG50CPIPA7\nFPzDojfhcOmVZx0rbOeL6B2OLSgAQXQJ7FITdKxNGjfo+n4/fs6N9e9TcI0tzb6h\nxIkgq3HKZrwyGsxzBre2dEe7qxlfmxvSeU+NDwDoNjqMum7DubRDTcm8d2Wvtuvb\nNQVCnFAr/72nX+0CFme4yF0D7lGtGKTBe0GzKy5X5+3Z6KjqGIfWlJ6RF81eJLMu