il":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"fix(supervisor): Enviar al Colaborador graba antes de cambiar a Enviado\n\nEl boton releia la evaluacion del API y la grababa como ''Enviado'',\ndescartando las respuestas del supervisor que no habian pasado por\n\"Guardar Avance\" (que ademas no funcionaba en medio ano: el ViewChild\nsolo apuntaba al formulario final). 61 evaluaciones del periodo 8\nllegaron al colaborador sin calificacion del supervisor.\n\n- form-evaluation-medio-ano: persistir(estado) + someterAlColaborador()\n- form-evaluacion-supervisor: ViewChild del formulario de medio ano;\n  Guardar Avance sirve para ambos; Enviar graba y somete en una sola\n  operacion (medio ano) o exige avance grabado (evaluacion final)\n- scripts/reabrir_evaluaciones_sin_supervisor_p8_20260907.sql:\n  reapertura ejecutada en produccion el 2026-09-07 con respaldo\n  _bak_Evaluacion_reapertura_20260907 (61 filas)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FGhNWqvUTb5zHkckwHjDAe","tree":{"sha":"e6af0ecedb0668a0bf3834f6838fd97c9ec48f85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/e6af0ecedb0668a0bf3834f6838fd97c9ec48f85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/7f333d800699f54306fbb3eb1fc4ef0e4c314f85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXN