_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/2efa506499f70fdcb7c41077fb21a0748bc0a7af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:42:43Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T16:42:43Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"chore(produccion): copia de competencias del puesto 54 a los puestos 270 y 271\n\nLos puestos GERENTE DE CAPTACIONES Y SUCURSAL (270) y GERENTE DE SUCURSAL\nPEQUENA (271) no tenian competencias en el periodo 8, asi que el sistema nunca\ngenero la evaluacion de las cuatro personas que los ocupan y no podian\nautoevaluarse.\n\nEl guion copia las 12 competencias de GERENTE DE SUCURSAL MEDIANA (54) -la\nplantilla que eligio Rhay-, previsualiza antes de escribir y no duplica si se\nvuelve a correr. Ejecutado en produccion el 2026-08-26: 24 filas creadas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df0ac80c39723d324b48f42ecb61b6d19346e885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/df0ac80c39723d324b48f42ecb61b6d19346e885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/2efa506499f70fdcb7c41077fb21a0748bc0a7af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","fo