,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/fd011f17b6014fd39da6373a3d482774d286769f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:47:44Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T14:47:44Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"test(competencias): verificacion con Playwright 12/12 y auditoria con evidencia\n\nRecorrido de 12 pasos ejecutado contra la aplicacion real (local con\nconfiguracion de prueba, API :7071, BD Evaluaciones_Test): 12 correctos, cero\nproblemas, cero omitidos. Quedan probados los nueve criterios del plan, incluido\nel borrado con confirmacion -la funcion que en la pantalla vieja ni siquiera\nllamaba al API- y la escritura de la ponderacion, ejercida sobre el periodo\ncerrado de 2024 para no tocar el calculo de las evaluaciones en curso.\n\nHicieron falta cinco corridas, y el dato incomodo queda documentado en la §2 de\nla auditoria: los cinco veredictos negativos que produjo el recorrido fueron del\npropio guion, ninguno del sistema. De ahi la regla que hereda quien lo repita:\nante un fallo, la primera hipotesis es la prueba, no la aplicacion.\n\nLa primera corrida confirmo EN VIVO el defecto A del API: se crearon 14\ncompetencias desde la pantalla (Goal 11372-11385) y los cuatro GET siguieron\ndevolviendo cero, porque el puesto tiene departamento 0. La interfaz no puede\ndistinguir un puesto vacio de uno lleno ni despues de haberlo llenado ella misma.\n\nLa base quedo idéntica: 7.921 metas, 115 en el periodo 8, ponderaciones 30/70.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"64d622c9e5089fc371399c2e5c8e7f18658b268b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/64d622c9e5089fc371399c2e5c8e7f18658b268b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/fd011f17b6014fd39da6373a3d482774d286769f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/fd011f17b6014fd39da6373a3d482774d286769f","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKGZkMDExZjE3YjYwMTRmZDM5ZGE2MzczYTNkNDgyNzc0ZDI4Njc2OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460","sha":"af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460"}],"sha":"fd011f17b6014fd39da6373a3d482774d286769f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/fd011f17b6014fd39da6373a3d482774d286769f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T12:04:36Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-25T12:04:36Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"test(competencias): arreglos del guion tras la primera corrida real\n\nTres fallos que solo aparecieron al ejecutarlo contra la aplicacion:\n\n1. waitUntil networkidle no se cumple nunca con ng serve, porque el websocket\n   de recarga en caliente mantiene la red activa: el recorrido se colgaba antes\n   de la primera captura. Se usa domcontentloaded.\n2. El menu de administrador no esta listo al terminar el login: navmenu carga\n   periodo, luego empleado y solo entonces pide EmpleadoRols. Con una espera fija\n   de 2,5 s el guion concluia en falso que el usuario no era admin. Ahora espera\n   a que aparezca, hasta 30 s, y si no aparece reporta el rol que hay guardado.\n3. La navegacion por URL no sirve como alternativa: navmenu.component.ts:86 llama\n   a router.navigate([''Home'']) en cada arranque de sesion, asi que cualquier\n   enlace directo con recarga termina en Home. La prueba del guard tambien pasa a\n   entrar por el menu, porque por URL habria dado un falso \"el guard bloqueo\".\n\nIncluye diag-rol.spec.js, el guion de diagnostico que permitio localizarlo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a328ebbfdf5a66de3e0d05a81b9b7ac5cb15b167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/a328ebbfdf5a66de3e0d05a81b9b7ac5cb15b167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKGFmNWJmZTg4N2JmMmQ2ZGVjMjJiYjZjOTdkNmZlYjAxZTczYTQ0NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2","sha":"956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2"}],"sha":"af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/af5bfe887bf2d6dec22bb6c97d6feb01e73a4460"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:39:19Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T22:39:19Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"test(competencias): guion de verificacion con Playwright y estructura de auditoria\n\nRecorrido de 12 pasos por la pantalla nueva, con dos modos: solo lectura y\nescritura. Cada paso captura pantalla y verifica algo, no solo fotografia.\n\nSalvaguardas: lista blanca de escritura en los puestos 94 y 102 (confirmados\nvacios), el puesto 19 bloqueado por codigo porque tiene 12 metas ocultas por el\ndefecto del API, las filas creadas llevan un sello unico para poder borrarlas\ndespues, y un cortafuegos aborta si la URL apunta a produccion.\n\nNo trata \"ningun semaforo en verde\" como fallo: en el periodo 8 los diez puestos\nconfigurados suman 96 o 99, y el verde solo se puede demostrar ajustando un peso.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2282abc3bba4d50ac336186a70fa29d7da071c20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/2282abc3bba4d50ac336186a70fa29d7da071c20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKDk1NmJiMDBhNTQyYmJhZDRlY2NkOTE2Nzg3MjMzNDk0NDNlZDRhZTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/6b34c546b94454e2c143ed97932b49913fee324c","sha":"6b34c546b94454e2c143ed97932b49913fee324c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/6b34c546b94454e2c143ed97932b49913fee324c"}],"sha":"956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/956bb00a542bbad4eccd91678723349443ed4ae2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/6b34c546b94454e2c143ed97932b49913fee324c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:32:11Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:32:11Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat(competencias): T2.1 competencias por puesto con semaforo, alta multiple y clonado — aprobado por critico\n\nListado de los 209 puestos con departamento, cantidad, peso total y semaforo\n(tolerancia 0,5, no igualdad exacta), filtros por departamento, puesto, \"solo\nsin competencias\" y \"solo ocupados\". Al elegir un puesto: tabla de sus\ncompetencias con edicion y borrado con confirmacion, que advierte cuando el\nperiodo esta activo. Alta multiple de todo el catalogo en una sola operacion y\nclonado desde otro puesto o periodo con previsualizacion obligatoria.\n\nEl semaforo tiene un cuarto estado para los puestos ocupados con departamento 0,\ndonde el API no puede confirmar el cero: dice que hay que configurarlos, avisa\nde la duda y remite a SQL. Sin ese estado la pantalla invitaria a duplicar las\ncompetencias del puesto 19. Acotado a puestos ocupados, son 8 filas de 209 en\nlugar de 115.\n\nLos errores del API se muestran con su mensaje real. Ninguna pantalla propone ya\n\"abra el detalle para comprobar\": el detalle lee del mismo endpoint con el mismo\njoin y saldria igual de vacio.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d59a3357e497bfd651b665d3ff5703f854c8f249","url":"https://ap