os defectos que condicionan lo que la pantalla\npuede prometer: el join sin DefaultIfEmpty() que oculta 309 metas en 13 puestos,\ny la proyeccion de /api/Positions que devuelve categoria 0 en los 209.\n\nIncluye la reconciliacion del critico entre las dos mediciones (115 puestos con\ndepartamento 0 frente a 13 con metas ocultas: mismo criterio, distinto universo)\ny corrige el dato de que los 8 puestos ocupados no son subconjunto de los 13.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"904e59261b16f9decddc0b1fec9ab68355a035bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/904e59261b16f9decddc0b1fec9ab68355a035bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/e1210eaa91db9b20d43c9e22b86f340723d50be9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/e1210eaa91db9b20d43c9e22b86f340723d50be9","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKGUxMjEwZWFhOTFkYjliMjBkNDNjOWUyMmI4NmYzNDA3MjNkNTBiZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1","sha":"d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1"}],"sha":"e1210eaa91db9b20d43c9e22b86f340723d50be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/e1210eaa91db9b20d43c9e22b86f340723d50be9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:15:12Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:15:12Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat(competencias): T2.3 ponderacion del periodo y diagnostico de configuracion — aprobado por critico\n\nPonderacion: ver y fijar el % Desempeno/Competencia del periodo, exigiendo que\nsume 100 y releyendo tras guardar (el PUT responde 204, asi que la respuesta no\nprueba nada). Si el periodo no tiene filas -lo que le paso al periodo 8 y nadie\nnoto hasta revisarlo a mano- ofrece copiarlas del periodo anterior.\n\nDiagnostico: los tres listados que hoy se sacan por SQL (puestos sin\ncompetencias, puestos sin categoria valida, empleados sin evaluacion),\nexportables a Excel. El de empleados sin evaluacion coincide exacto con el SQL\nen los tres periodos (105/56/444).\n\nSobre el defecto del join: se comprobo que los cuatro GET de GoalsController\nusan `from depa in _context.Deparments.Where(...)` sin DefaultIfEmpty(), asi que\nninguno se salva. El API deja ver 7612 de las 7921 metas que hay en base de\ndatos; 309 quedan ocultas en 13 puestos. En vez de elegir un endpoint \"bueno\",\nel diagnostico aisla los puestos que no puede verificar en un bloque aparte y\ndice que la confirmacion es por SQL, para que nadie cree competencias a ciegas\nsobre un puesto que ya las tiene.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a63e0240362976fc3490a272762371d98d627b0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/a63e0240362976fc3490a272762371d98d627b0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKGQ3ODRjM2NiNWViOTY1NzdmZGMzODJkNzY5OWY2NGM0YWFjYWU1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/99f85156381bd92542221b134da983a9a184f7ff","sha":"99f85156381bd92542221b134da983a9a184f7ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/99f85156381bd92542221b134da983a9a184f7ff"}],"sha":"d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/d784c3cb5eb96577fdc382d7699f64c4aacae5f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/99f85156381bd92542221b134da983a9a184f7ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:15:11Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T19:15:11Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat(competencias): T2.2 catalogo del periodo y matriz de categorias — aprobado por critico\n\nPone en pantalla lo que hasta hoy solo se hacia por SQL: alta, edicion y\nborrado del catalogo Objetivo del periodo, y la matriz competencia x categoria\nde puesto donde marcar crea el vinculo y desmarcar lo borra.\n\nNo confia en el codigo HTTP: cada escritura se relee y se compara, y si el API\nrespondio 200 sin procesar la casilla vuelve sola a su sitio y avisa. El copiado\ndesde otro periodo previsualiza, deduplica por nombre + grupo (igual que el\nINSERT de referencia) y resuelve los ids releyendo el catalogo en vez de confiar\nen la respuesta del POST.\n\nDocumenta un defecto encontrado: GET /api/Objetivoes hace inner join con periodo,\nestado y grupo, asi que oculta competencias con esos ids invalidos (las huerfanas\n71-76). Ninguna esta referenciada, pero el copiado avisa por si aparecieran.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15e45b8408b3fa3f19e77038b7ddec6a7d197dba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/15e45b8408b3fa3f19e77038b7ddec6a7d197dba"},"url":"https://api.gith