ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/9ccc3b90c25269b3cf693b0d69176ee31246d032/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:40:34Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-24T18:40:34Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat(competencias): T1.2 borrado, alta en lote y clonado en Metas — aprobado por critico\n\nAgrega a Metas.ts lo que la pantalla nunca pudo hacer: Delete real contra\nDELETE /api/Goals/{id}, insertarLote que no aborta el lote ante una fila\nfallida, clonado en dos pasos (previsualizarClonado / ejecutarClonado) que\ndeduplica por puesto + competencia + descripcion, y resumenPorPuesto para el\nsemaforo de peso.\n\nLa previsualizacion devuelve advertencias cuando el puesto de origen o destino\nno aparece en el listado del API: GET /api/Goals hace join con Deparments y\noculta los puestos con Departmentsecuencial = 0, asi que en esos casos el\nclonado podria duplicar y solo se confirma por SQL.\n\nNinguna firma existente cambio; las cuatro pantallas que consumen este\ncontrolador quedan intactas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65772be20796e4d3254212a71b7f708061838997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/65772be20796e4d3254212a71b7f708061838997"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/9ccc3b90c25269b3cf693b0d69176ee31246d032","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/9ccc3b90c25269b3cf693b0d69176ee31246d032","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKDljY2MzYjkwYzI1MjY5YjNjZjY5M2IwZDY5MTc2ZWUzMTI0NmQwMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/6719c0d3ff6d3ea5ebc4cd4d65c9dfe10b4e3619","sha":"6719c0d3ff6d3ea5ebc4cd4d65c9dfe10b4e3619","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/eval