ndo parametro queda como atajo opcional), asi que no puede devolver la\nmatriz de todos los periodos mezclada. Update se tipa como Observable<any>\nporque el PUT responde 204 sin cuerpo, y el JSDoc lo deja dicho.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f9d948a7be0b193596acd9eb8e8859e7d4756f61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/f9d948a7be0b193596acd9eb8e8859e7d4756f61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/6719c0d3ff6d3ea5ebc4cd4d65c9dfe10b4e3619","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/6719c0d3ff6d3ea5ebc4cd4d65c9dfe10b4e3619","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKDY3MTljMGQzZmY2ZDNlYTVlYmM0Y2Q0ZDY1YzlkZmUxMGI0ZTM2MTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdo