 y @Output cambios\nque consumira la Fase 2.\n\nCorrige de paso un hueco de seguridad: la ruta /Meta solo tenia AuthGuard,\nasi que cualquier usuario autenticado entraba al mantenimiento de metas\nescribiendo la URL. Ahora exige RoleGuard con rol Admin.\n\nVerificado: npm run build exit 0 (sin avisos nuevos), ngc con strictTemplates\nsin errores, CSS del shell 1.3 kB.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a3baf7567635c683f1069438cce8de36c4eacbd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/7a3baf7567635c683f1069438cce8de36c4eacbd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/f457ccc9f0143312677106ab443c41563eb77679","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/f457ccc9f0143312677106ab443c41563eb77679","nod