"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/18cce8cee65f680cfe71a6e98ce46eeaa96c5d67"}],"sha":"1a60d3bb2c3d4c664dcf5d9131a90b50e194dd5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/1a60d3bb2c3d4c664dcf5d9131a90b50e194dd5c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/18cce8cee65f680cfe71a6e98ce46eeaa96c5d67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:11:24Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T16:11:24Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"fix: fechas de firma reales en la evaluacion de mitad de ano\n\nLa fecha de firma salia de fechaRepuestas, que el API sobrescribe con\nDateTime.Now en CADA PUT (EvaluacionsController). O sea que nunca fue una\nfecha de firma: era la ultima modificacion, y cuando el supervisor grababa\nse llevaba por delante la fecha del colaborador. Los dos recuadros pintaban\nese mismo valor.\n\nAdemas, el recuadro del supervisor decidia si mostrar \"firmado\" con\n*ngIf=\"supervisor\", o sea segun QUIEN estaba mirando: el colaborador nunca\nveia firmado a su supervisor, y el supervisor se veia firmado a si mismo\napenas abria el formulario.\n\nBackend (repo EvaluacionEmpleadosApi):\n- Evaluacion: FechaFirmaColaborador y FechaFirmaSupervisor (datetime2 null).\n- PutEvaluacion sella cada una del lado del servidor la primera vez que esa\n  parte compromete su evaluacion, y no las vuelve a mover.\n- La proyeccion del GET devuelve ambas.\n- Migracion AddFechasFirma.\n\nFrontend:\n- IEvaluacion expone las dos fechas.\n- Cada recuadro de firma sale de su propia fecha, no de quien mira.\n- fechaRepuestas queda documentada como \"ultima modificacion\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35ca59d03ad99f3108f06a21081e22467b6d4c3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/35ca59d03ad99f3108f06a21081e22467b6d4c3d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/18cce8cee65f680cfe71a6e98ce46eeaa96c5d67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_e