alcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/7ef13d8c52b034580cb339e5ee6e2c42eb702472/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:52:02Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T14:52:02Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat: ajustes de la seccion de cierre de mitad de ano (reunion RRHH)\n\n- Plan de accion editable para el supervisor: se acuerda en la conversacion\n  de mitad de ano, asi que el supervisor debe poder ajustarlo mientras revisa.\n  Antes la matriz le abria en solo lectura.\n- Se quita el textarea \"Comentarios del Supervisor\". El campo sigue viajando\n  en el JSON para no perder lo ya guardado, y si trae contenido se muestra\n  como nota del formato anterior (mismo patron que el lado del colaborador).\n- \"Compromisos del Supervisor / Proximos Pasos\" pasa a \"Compromiso y\n  Comentario\", con el texto guia que definio Gestion Humana. El campo del\n  colaborador queda igual: bloqueado para el supervisor.\n- El boton que ve el colaborador cuando el supervisor ya sometio la\n  evaluacion decia \"Completar Evaluacion\"; ahora dice \"Aceptar Evaluacion\",\n  igual que en el formulario de fin de ano.\n\nSolo texto y permisos de edicion; sin cambios de modelo de datos.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d97682531ddb9656842686c06247b857c36ec50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/0d97682531ddb9656842686c06247b857c36ec50"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/7ef13d8c52b034580cb339e5ee6e2c42eb702472","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/7ef13d8c52b034580cb339e5ee6e2c42eb702472","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKDdlZjEzZDhjNTJiMDM0NTgwY2IzMzllNWVlNmUyYzQyZWI3MDI0NzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/f4be23f8c5fcff9d137ff8e0c8ec3657ddc78c82","sha":"f4be23f8c5fcff9d137ff8e0c8ec3657ddc78c82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/f4be23f8c5fcff9d137ff8e0c8ec3657ddc78c82"}],"sha":"7ef13d8c52b034580cb339e5ee6e2c42eb702472","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/7ef13d8c52b034580cb339e5ee6e2c42eb702472"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/f4be23f8c5fcff9d137ff8e0c8ec3657ddc78c82/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:32:09Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T12:32:09Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"merge: textos de Evaluacion de Mitad de Ano 2026 en la rama de plan de accion\n\nIntegra la rama textos/mitad-de-ano-2026, que quedo sin fusionar desde el\n20-jul. El correo de Gestion Humana pide seis cambios; los cinco de texto\nvivian en esa rama y el boton de plan de accion en esta, asi que ninguna de\nlas dos cubria el correo completo.\n\nSin conflictos: las dos ramas tocan el mismo formulario pero en secciones\ndistintas (titulos y definiciones vs. seccion de cierre y