dmin, igual que\nel resto de reportes): lista todas las acciones registradas en la matriz\nde plan de accion de mitad de ano, con selector de periodo, busqueda,\nfiltro de vencidas (fechaCierre < hoy), resumen y exportacion a Excel.\nLee el JSON planAccion de colaboradorCompromisos en el cliente y cruza\ncon Empleados para nombre y departamento; las evaluaciones con texto\ndel formato anterior se omiten sin error.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0ad83af317d84bf8923c2ff3141d1a30630c297c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/0ad83af317d84bf8923c2ff3141d1a30630c297c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/64d36a12a448a570bb450193f0195d4926f4f91c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/64d36a12a44