ecicla el app pool tras el swap (cache de IIS servia el build viejo)\n\nEl rename de carpetas deja el file cache de IIS con handles a la\ncarpeta anterior: el disco tiene el build nuevo pero IIS sigue\nsirviendo el index viejo (tocar timestamps no lo invalida). Se agrega\nReset-CacheIIS via WinRM (hostname srv-sifizsoft3, Kerberos) que\nrecicla EvaluacionFrontendPrueba, pool dedicado del sitio prueba,\nsin afectar produccion ni loginapp (DefaultAppPool).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6123253124946206b14beabf4f8357ec1a826168","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/6123253124946206b14beabf4f8357ec1a826168"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/7ed5079b79ec1e6d444883a060ba54d81ced1007","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/7ed5079b79ec1e6d444883a060ba54d81ced1007","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKDdlZDUwNzliNzllYzFlNmQ0NDQ4ODNhMDYwYmE1NGQ4MWNlZDEwMDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/1dd168f98c10452a9c7ea4c4b8e87d12fa65adda","sha":"1dd168f98c10452a9c7ea4c4b8e87d12fa65adda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/1dd168f98c10452a9c7ea4c4b8e87d12fa65adda"}],"sha":"7ed5079b79ec1e6d444883a060ba54d81ced1007","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/7ed5079b79ec1e6d444883a060ba54d81ced1007"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/1dd168f98c10452a9c7ea4c4b8e87d12fa65adda/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:11:34Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-22T19:11:34Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"feat: boton ''Plan de accion'' con matriz 7x5 en modal (interino via JSON)\n\nImplementa el cuadro solicitado por RRHH en la validacion de QA:\n- Nuevo PlanAccionMatrizComponent (MatDialog): matriz de 7 columnas\n  (#, Acciones, Objetivo/competencia, Responsable, Soporte, Recursos,\n  Fecha de cierre) x 5 filas, con grabar/cancelar. El colaborador\n  edita; supervisor y solo-lectura la ven deshabilitada.\n- El textarea interino ''Plan de accion'' se reemplaza por el boton +\n  contador de acciones registradas. Si habia texto guardado con el\n  formato anterior se muestra como nota de solo lectura.\n- Persistencia INTERINA: IAccionPlan[] viaja como planAccion dentro\n  del JSON {comentarios, compromisos} en ColaboradorCompromisos\n  (nvarchar(max), verificado en Evaluaciones_Test). La migracion a la\n  tabla EvaluacionPlanAccion del API queda para cuando RRHH responda\n  las preguntas abiertas (Docs/diseno-plan-accion-medio-ano.md).\n- onAceptar no reescribe el campo y onSubmit del supervisor re-serializa\n  la matriz cargada: no hay perdida de datos en ningun camino de guardado.\n\nVerificado: build:prod verde; test:ci 24 FAILED / 31 SUCCESS (identico\nal baseline, fallos pre-existentes de specs autogenerados).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caf674b6e57be77f8e4c14b3850251de8d3c23ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/caf674b6e57be77f8e4c14b3850251de8d3c23ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/1dd168f98c10452a9c7ea4c4b8e87d12fa65adda","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https