.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/26129f74561053f484ebe9584143ffc17623d71c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:11:26Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-07T16:11:26Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"Rhay Alcantara"},"message":"test: agrega test unitario para loadLogoAsBase64 en UtilsService (T6.4)\n\nUtilsService.loadLogoAsBase64() ya existia verbatim (y con la ruta de\nasset correcta, sin el bug de backslash de los 2 duplicados vetados en\nFormEvaluationEmploye y form-evaluation-medio-ano - conectarlos es\ntarea de T7.5). Se agrega el test unitario que faltaba: intercepta la\npeticion HTTP del logo via HttpTestingController y verifica que\nlogoBase64 termina siendo un data URL.\n\nDe paso, se corrige el mock de DatosServiceService en el spec (le\nfaltaba getdatos(), necesario porque UtilsService inyecta Evaluacion,\nque en su constructor llama PorcientoDesempenoCompetencia.Gets() ->\ndatos.getdatos(...)). Esto arregla los 2 fallos preexistentes de este\nspec documentados en Docs/baseline-fase0.md (\"TypeError: this.datos.getdatos\nis not a function\"). Tests: 24 FAILED/31 SUCCESS (antes 26/28), sin\nregresiones nuevas.","tree":{"sha":"cb75d0072cb56b45496af8a7da6ecfd3da963bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/cb75d0072cb56b45496af8a7da6ecfd3da963bc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/26129f74561053f484ebe9584143ffc17623d71c