feat: amplia retroalimentacion de evaluacion de medio ano\n\nAjustes solicitados por RRHH para el formulario de medio ano:\n- Instruccion principal de Retroalimentacion mas grande y en negrita;\n  ahora menciona \"proyectos\" y la justificacion con competencias (hasta 3).\n- Descripciones largas en las 4 categorias (Continuar, Hacer Mas,\n  Hacer Menos, Parar), tanto en el bloque del colaborador como del supervisor.\n- Nueva seccion \"Comentarios, Compromisos y Proximos Pasos\" con campo\n  Comentarios (colaborador y supervisor), persistido como JSON\n  {comentarios, compromisos} en los campos *Compromisos existentes\n  (sin cambios de backend/BD).\n- Campos del supervisor: [disabled]=\"!supervisor || sololectura\" para que\n  el colaborador no edite lo del supervisor en evaluaciones Completadas.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"daba1514593d96e51c0f4345a972efbd84e1c93d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/daba1514593d96e51c0f4345a972efbd84e1c93d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/9e6390a1bc264152f0f25d04497cdc5b335a4cee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://a