"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/8c3e553abd42c77475de407a1bf60d32fcf72168/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:03:12Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"rhayalcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:03:12Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"rhayalcantara"},"message":"ola 3 I: opciones post-evaluacion Conforme/Inconforme/En conocimiento/De acuerdo\n\nReemplaza los radio buttons binarios (Conformidad/No Conformidad) por 4 opciones\nclaras con estilos de tarjeta en la seccion de aceptacion (estado=Enviado):\n  - Conforme          -> aceptaEnDisgusto=false, comentario=''''\n  - De acuerdo        -> aceptaEnDisgusto=false, comentario=''De acuerdo''\n  - En conocimiento   -> aceptaEnDisgusto=false, comentario=''En conocimiento''\n  - Inconforme        -> aceptaEnDisgusto=true,  comentario=texto del usuario\n\nNueva propiedad opcionAceptacion mapea hacia los campos de BD existentes sin\ncambiar el modelo. Inconforme requiere comentario obligatorio antes de aceptar.\nReverse-mapping carga la opcion correcta al abrir una evaluacion ya procesada.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthro