8561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commits/faf90eb87b7648cf6dc5b8a56b2b75153b1550dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:37:29Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"rhayalcantara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T13:37:29Z","email":"rhayalcantara@gmail.com","name":"rhayalcantara"},"message":"ola 1: vista supervisor lista, botones inicio, terminologia, pdf, perspectivas, estado devuelta\n\nA: evaluar-subordinados — reemplaza tarjetas por tabla responsive con columnas\n   Nombre/Depto/Posicion/Estado(badge)/Puntuacion/Acciones; carga estado de\n   evaluacion por colaborador via GetEvaluacionEstadoDts\n\nB: agrega boton \"← Inicio\" al inicio de FormEvaluationEmploye, form-evaluation-\n   medio-ano y form-evaluacion-supervisor (top + bottom donde faltaba)\n\nC: criterialitem y form-evaluation-medio-ano — \"Medio Verificacion\"→\"¿Como se Mide?\",\n   \"Logro\"→\"Resultado\", \"%\"→\"% Logro\", \"Documentar Resultado\"→\"Nota o comentario\"\n\nD: utils.service — agrega seccion \"RESULTADOS OBJETIVOS (Desempeno)\" en ambas\n   funciones de generacion de PDF (generatePDFEvaluacion y generatePDFEvaluacionBlob)\n\nE: form-plan-estrategico — perspectiva cambia de input texto libre a select con\n   las 4 perspectivas BSC predefinidas\n\nF: estado \"Devuelta\" — supervisor puede devolver evaluacion con nota via SweetAlert2;\n   card-empleado muestra boton naranja cuando estado es AutoEvaluado o\n   EvaluadoPorSupervisor; FormEvaluationEmploye muestra alerta amarilla con nota\n   cuando estado=Devuelta y permite re-editar\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"378d399be9390c83ad102d257a6b2c517d3948aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/trees/378d399be9390c83ad102d257a6b2c517d3948aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/git/commits/faf90eb87b7648cf6dc5b8a56b2b75153b1550dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/27428561?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara","id":27428561,"login":"rhayalcantara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDI4NTYx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rhayalcantara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/faf90eb87b7648cf6dc5b8a56b2b75153b1550dd","node_id":"C_kwDOMo-Jc9oAKGZhZjkwZWI4N2I3NjQ4Y2Y2ZGM1YjhhNTZiMmI3NTE1M2IxNTUwZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rhayalcantara/evaluacionesEmpleadosdocker/commit/664027f43af0c7871902a68b20c0e54df