te":"2026-01-30T15:35:41Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"MoneyFool9","providerType":"User"},"email":"jiahqian@gmail.com","name":"Fool"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:30:47.065Z","repositoryId":850991251,"sha":"c687cc2b5d6b358a21fbe0650abf017d9e6a8ee4"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"MoneyFool9","providerType":"User"},"email":"jiahqian@gmail.com","name":"qianjh"},"authoredDate":"2026-01-30T12:43:22Z","committedDate":"2026-01-30T12:46:20Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"MoneyFool9","providerType":"User"},"email":"jiahqian@gmail.com","name":"qianjh"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:30:47.065Z","repositoryId":850991251,"sha":"9a5afecedef868db4ee8223c086762d43b79ba00"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T18:30:47.065Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c33906ec824a104c4b3fd8356c4200485f6d3af8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:50:25Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:50:25Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 分段上限 700 → 2000，保住代码块完整\n\n--fences 揭示了真问题所在：366 个奇围栏分段中，214 个只是开围栏被 Dify\n剥离（内容完整），但 152 个确实被截断——截断点是 class/function 中间，\n代码失去了声明部分。查证发现根因在本地的「超长代码块等分切分」：全库\n1067 个代码块中有 156 个（14.6%）超过 700 字阈值而被切开。\n\n代码块完整性比 chunk 粒度更重要——切开后两半都读不懂，而 chunk 大一些\n只是召回稍粗。把 DEFAULT_CHUNK_CHARS 提到 2000：\n\n  被切开的代码块    156 (14.6%) → 3 (0.3%)\n  真断裂分段        152          → 0\n  超 Dify 硬切上限   —            → 0\n  中位长度 440 字，p90 1223 字","tree":{"sha":"99cadcdfd81a08c107fb28776e1ce94391c00ce0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/99cadcdfd81a08c107fb28776e1ce94391c00ce0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/c33906ec824a104c4b3fd8356c4200485f6d3af8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/c33906ec824a104c4b3fd8356c4200485f6d3af8","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGMzMzkwNmVjODI0YTEwNGM0YjNmZDgzNTZjNDIwMDQ4NWY2ZDNhZjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7","sha":"c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7"}],"sha":"c33906ec824a104c4b3fd8356c4200485f6d3af8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c33906ec824a104c4b3fd8356c4200485f6d3af8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:43:55Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:43:55Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 修正围栏断裂的误报，改用花括号配对与结构特征判定\n\n打印完整原文后真相清楚了：那个「断裂」的 451 字段落，代码从\ninterface Square { 到 } 完全完整、花括号成对，唯一异常是开头的 ``` 被\nDify 换成了语言标记 typescript。也就是说，Dify 索引前会剥离开围栏，\n导致内容完整的分段围栏数也是奇数——只看围栏数会大幅误报。\n\nisTrulyBroken() 改判两点：剥离开头语言标记后花括号/圆括号是否成对，\n以及是否以围栏收尾但结构不平。--fences 现在分别统计「仅开围栏被剥离」\n与「内容真被截断」，前者不影响检索。","tree":{"sha":"c8ef727f8c435782d8f2443f363785ffc1a3792b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/c8ef727f8c435782d8f2443f363785ffc1a3792b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGMyZjNiMzE0Mjg4MjcwZjhlNTRlMzdmOTY2ZGIyMDFjYmI0YjZiYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84","sha":"be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84"}],"sha":"c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c2f3b314288270f8e54e37f966db201cbb4b6bc7"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:40:44Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:40:44Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): --fences 判定奇围栏分段的内容是否完整\n\n样例显示分段以 typescript 开头、以 ``` 结尾，代码内容看着是完整的——\n若如此，则只是 Dify 剥离了开围栏（不影响检索），而非内容被切断。\n新增判定：剥离开头语言标记后，花括号是否成对且以围栏收尾；并打印一个\n奇围栏分段的完整原文供人工核对。","tree":{"sha":"3c3dbf6df7e045068076c6e6019b525821ac9283","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/3c3dbf6df7e045068076c6e6019b525821ac9283"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGJlN2QwOWNmZDk4Nzg0ZTI5YjU4NWVmZjY3ZDZhZTZmOGMxMzJjODQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656","sha":"375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656"}],"sha":"be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/be7d09cfd98784e29b585eff67d6ae6f8c132c84"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:37:34Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:37:34Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"chore(ci): 工作流暴露 fences 参数","tree":{"sha":"5bfc07d65819b6177315683be3d9d8b6a7919ef8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/5bfc07d65819b6177315683be3d9d8b6a7919ef8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDM3NWVhNGQyZTc5MGM4MWMwZGVmZWVmY2ZkZTAxZjMzZDNjN2E2NTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04","sha":"089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04"}],"sha":"375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/375ea4d2e790c81c0defeefcfde01f33d3c7a656"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:37:22Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:37:22Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --fences 诊断 Dify 对代码围栏的处理\n\n线上分段样例显示「以 typescript 开头、以 ``` 结尾」——开围栏不见了，\n只剩语言标记。若 Dify 索引前会剥离围栏，那么本地的围栏计数根本不能\n反映真实存储，本地零断裂与线上 18.7% 也就并不矛盾。\n\n--fences 统计各文档中围栏数为零/奇/偶的分段占比，并采样「以语言标记\n开头但无围栏」的分段，据此判定是围栏被剥离还是内容被切断。","tree":{"sha":"cabca786b1085e0585328194dadded0225a7dd3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/cabca786b1085e0585328194dadded0225a7dd3c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDA4OWRkN2Q5YjgxMzJiNjUyYjJjNjJjYmM3ZWQ0ZDNiZjQ4OGJkMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e","sha":"a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e"}],"sha":"089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/089dd7d9b8132b652b2c62cbc7ed4d3bf488bd04"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:34:00Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T15:34:00Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): --structure 输出断裂分段的原文首尾与长度分布\n\n本地构建已确认零断裂，但 Dify 实际存储中有 18.7% 的分段围栏不成对。\n需区分是「Dify 二次切分」还是「围栏计数误判」——前者要看断点位置，\n所以把首尾原文（换行显形为 ⏎）与长度分布一并输出。","tree":{"sha":"e796f105cb018273e4f2c6740d1e95902b0aa369","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/e796f105cb018273e4f2c6740d1e95902b0aa369"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGE3MWZmNTVhZDczOWJlMDMzMWFlOTU1NjU2YmJmYmM4ZmYyYWQ1NWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312","sha":"4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312"}],"sha":"a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a71ff55ad739be0331ae955656bbfbc8ff2ad55e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:43:48Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:43:48Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 重试时不再回退到已删除的文档 ID\n\n上一轮 16/18 成功，2 篇失败于「HTTP 404: Document not found」。原因：\n限流重试前会删掉损坏的文档，但 submit() 仍会回退到循环开始时读到的\nexisting.id，于是拿到的是已删除的 ID。\n\n- existing 改为 let，文档被删除后置为 null 并从 remote 缓存移除\n- submit() 只信任调用方传入的 currentId，不再依赖陈旧缓存\n- 可恢复错误扩充 404 Document not found，走同一「删除后重建」路径","tree":{"sha":"c6252d342b1d7b8a34b1645e017b6c939015c151","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/c6252d342b1d7b8a34b1645e017b6c939015c151"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDRlMGU2MGJkZjI3ZDI4YjdjNTEyNTczY2QyZWE1MmE1M2VjYmIzMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52","sha":"a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52"}],"sha":"4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4e0e60bdf27d28b7c512573cd2ea52a53ecbb312"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:02:46Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T14:02:46Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 补上 LIMIT_RETRIES / RETRY_BASE_MS / BETWEEN_DOCS_MS 定义\n\n主循环替换时用到了这三个常量，但定义在前一轮编辑中丢失，导致脚本一启动\n就抛 \"LIMIT_RETRIES is not defined\"，18 篇全部失败。\n\n补齐定义并加可调环境变量：\n  DIFY_LIMIT_RETRIES    限流重试次数（默认 4）\n  DIFY_RETRY_BASE_MS    退避基数（默认 45s，第 n 次等 45s×n）\n  DIFY_BETWEEN_DOCS_MS  篇间停顿（默认 10s）\n\n本地 --dry-run 已通过：18 篇全部就绪，零失败。","tree":{"sha":"3257ce079a36bf9a9c27c5610209da58173a731b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/3257ce079a36bf9a9c27c5610209da58173a731b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGEwZjAxNTc3MDhhYTg1NTdkYjg1YzNhMmE4OWZkMWU5YWJjNjdhNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24","sha":"d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24"}],"sha":"a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/a0f0157708aa8557db85c3a2a89fd1e9abc67a52"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:56:35Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T13:56:35Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 真正替换主循环为 indexWithRetry 版本\n\n上一提交的文本替换因行号漂移而未生效：索引重试逻辑（indexWithRetry）\n已定义，但主循环仍在用旧的内联逻辑，所以日志里只出现「限流（429）」\n却从不重试——实测 4 篇仍因 429 失败。\n\n本次按代码锚点（而非硬编码行号）定位主循环并完成替换，确认全文件只剩\n一处循环、一处 indexWithRetry 调用。","tree":{"sha":"f4dd3aa866eec27bd6d1d5bd7bf8eec2b3f05876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/f4dd3aa866eec27bd6d1d5bd7bf8eec2b3f05876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGQwYjliNzY0MTY0NDFhYjk5ODIxZjY3Y2EwNTIyMzg0OWEyMGNiMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9","sha":"94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9"}],"sha":"d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0b9b76416441ab99821f67ca05223849a20cb24"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T12:01:52Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T12:01:52Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 限流自动退避重试，重写提交与恢复逻辑\n\n上一轮实测：18 篇全部成功重建，11 篇索引通过，7 篇因 429\nThrottling.RateQuota 失败。限流是瞬时故障，重试即可通过，但原脚本一旦\n撞上就记失败、不重试。\n\n- indexWithRetry()：单篇索引遇限流时按 45s/90s/135s 退避重试（最多 4 次）；\n  非限流错误立即放弃，不浪费时间\n- 重试前删除损坏文档：Dify 对 indexing=error 的文档会拒绝 update\n  （400 Document is not available），必须先删再建\n- 提交逻辑重写为幂等 submit()：文档损坏或 409 冲突时自动删旧建新；\n  新建前先核对远端同名文档并清理，避免反复撞 409\n- 篇间增加 10s 停顿（DIFY_BETWEEN_DOCS_MS），给供应商配额恢复时间\n- 新增可调参数：DIFY_LIMIT_RETRIES、DIFY_RETRY_BASE_MS、\n  DIFY_BETWEEN_DOCS_MS","tree":{"sha":"ea6020a7b261e182689d8aae6c613533de956ccc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/ea6020a7b261e182689d8aae6c613533de956ccc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDk0ZDk2MzM1NDIwODZjZWM2ZGJiODQ1ZDI3ZjUwMDk5MDI5ZTBiZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e","sha":"3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e"}],"sha":"94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/94d9633542086cec6dbb845d27f50099029e0be9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:49:48Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:49:48Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 文档处于 error 状态时改为删除重建\n\n全量同步持续报「HTTP 400: Document is not available」。--audit 显示这批\n文档的 indexing_status 都是 error、tokens=0——Dify 不允许对损坏状态的\n文档执行 update-by-text，只更新内容无法恢复它，必须删掉重建。\n\n新的失败处理路径：\n- 400 Document is not available → 删除远端文档后重新创建\n- 409 already exists → 仍走更新，不删除已有数据\n两条路径都会在 SERIAL_INDEX 下等待索引完成，并单独识别 429 限流。","tree":{"sha":"259b6c142a8e04acdc45d1c860e6ef6c915fa2a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/259b6c142a8e04acdc45d1c860e6ef6c915fa2a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDNlMmIwYzVmNjAwMTdhZTQ1MDNkOGUyMTMxNDQ3NjBiYjA4NWQ1MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef","sha":"25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef"}],"sha":"3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3e2b0c5f60017ae4503d8e213144760bb085d50e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:44:11Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:44:11Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 逐篇等待索引完成，根治 embedding 限流导致的整库索引失败\n\n--audit 打印文档级错误后，根因终于明确：\n\n  [models] Error: Response output is missing or does not contain embeddings:\n  {\"status_code\": 429, \"code\": \"Throttling.RateQuota\",\n   \"message\": \"Requests rate limit exceeded, please try again later\"}\n\n一次提交 18 篇（约 2000 个分段）时，Dify 会并发调用 embedding 接口，\n撞上阿里云百炼的速率限制，导致全部 18 篇 indexing=error、tokens=0——\n文档列表看着都在，实际一个向量都没建，检索自然全部落空，应用只能回答\n「不清楚」。这是一连串症状的真正源头。\n\n- 默认改为「逐篇提交 → 等该篇索引完成 → 再提交下一篇」，用串行化换取\n  稳定，避开供应商限流；--no-serial 可恢复批量提交\n- 等待期间识别 429/Throttling/RateQuota，单独提示为供应商限流，\n  并给出调大 DIFY_INDEX_WAIT_MS 的建议\n- DIFY_INDEX_WAIT_MS 控制单篇最长等待（默认 10 分钟）\n- 同时把 max_tokens 从 800 提到 2400：它不是合并目标而是硬切阈值，\n  我们已在输入侧按 700 字切好，调高可避免 Dify 二次硬切再次切断代码","tree":{"sha":"276572902a4d2e170d16eeef21ff80b92f1c238a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/276572902a4d2e170d16eeef21ff80b92f1c238a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDI1YmVhNjkzNGRkYmM0Mzk4YzljNDJmNTljODMxMWUxMDExYTk3ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545","sha":"4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545"}],"sha":"25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/25bea6934ddbc4398c9c42f59c8311e1011a97ef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:36:37Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:36:37Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): --audit 输出文档与批次的错误详情\n\n全部 18 篇文档处于 indexing=error、tokens=0，需要看到 Dify 记录的失败\n原因才能对症处理。现在打印文档级 error 字段、批次状态与其 error 内容。","tree":{"sha":"09066adfb29f0b9c17d04d940a5aa90b8863b442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/09066adfb29f0b9c17d04d940a5aa90b8863b442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDRhMDA4YTAxYjczMjNkNDRiYmM4NWJhYzc3NTVjZTg2MDk0MzM1NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b","sha":"3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b"}],"sha":"4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/4a008a01b7323d44bbc85bac7755ce8609433545"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:31:40Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:31:40Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): --audit 打印文档级状态，诊断 Document is not available\n\n全量同步报「HTTP 400: Document is not available」。该错误来自文档的\nenabled / indexing_status / status 异常，但原先只打印分段信息，看不出\n是哪一项不对。现在先输出文档级状态（enabled、indexing、status、\ndisplay_status、word_count、tokens、segment_count）再进入分段统计。","tree":{"sha":"1177fbfc61879245d293fae058c6e6e32c8aca31","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/1177fbfc61879245d293fae058c6e6e32c8aca31"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDNkZGY3NGI3YjBhYzkwMGZjOWMzYWM1NDI3MjAxMTJkZmNkMGQwM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780","sha":"1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780"}],"sha":"3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/3ddf74b7b0ac900fc9c3ac542720112dfcd0d03b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:22:28Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:22:28Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): 自己按安全边界切块，消除 17.6% 的代码截断\n\n--structure 实测真实分段后发现：1977 个分段中有 348 个（17.6%）代码围栏\n不成对。原因是含代码的章节超过 Dify 的 max_tokens（实测约 800 字）后被\n硬切，而硬切不认代码围栏——一段以代码结尾、下一段以剩余代码开头，两段\n都无法独立作答。这解释了「检索有结果但答不准」。\n\n改为在同步前由我们切好，不劳 Dify 动手：\n- 两阶段算法：先把章节拆成「正文单元」与「代码块单元」，再贪心装箱\n- 代码块是原子单元，绝不在内部断开；单个代码块超限时等分为若干块，\n  每块都补齐围栏（等分而非尽量装满，避免尾部只剩几行变成空壳）\n- 正文行自由切分，断点永远落在行边界\n- 首尾过短块分别并入相邻块，避免「## 4. 路由」这类只有标题的孤立碎片\n\n实测（本地模拟 18 篇文档）：\n  围栏断裂   17.6% → 0%\n  ≥800 字    18.4% → 0.7%\n  <80 字碎片   —   → 0.6%\n  长度分布：中位 448 字，p90 686 字","tree":{"sha":"fda7f5c9b0acb4869fa73b60894128112483977d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/fda7f5c9b0acb4869fa73b60894128112483977d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDFiZjUwOWZiZGUwZWE5MDY3NWVlNThlYTE4MmIyNTVlOTUwNDg3ODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174","sha":"2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174"}],"sha":"1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1bf509fbde0ea90675ee58ea182b255e95048780"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:13:58Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:13:58Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"fix(dify): --structure=all 处理为分析全部文档\n\n原先 all 会被当作文档名关键词而匹配不到任何文档。现在把 all / * /\n空值均视为不筛选，并打印待分析文档数。","tree":{"sha":"bc5b9fbafec9ed90f3c0a2c5dc08e3524da4d26c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/bc5b9fbafec9ed90f3c0a2c5dc08e3524da4d26c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDJlOWQ5YWMzNzc1MTNmMTE3ODVjNWFiYjFiYWQ3YjUzZjgyNzExNzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0","sha":"218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0"}],"sha":"2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/2e9d9ac377513f11785c5abb1bad7b53f8271174"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:11:08Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T10:11:08Z","email":"claudian@local","name":"Claudian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --structure 分析分段结构，检查代码是否被截断\n\n实测发现 nodejs 笔记被切成 39 段（平均 654 字），看似正常，但逐段核对\n可见内容已损坏：含代码的章节超过 max_tokens=800 后被 Dify 硬切，而硬切\n不认代码围栏，把 ``` 从中切开——一段以代码结尾、下一段以剩余代码开头，\n两段都无法独立回答。\n\n--structure 逐段检查三项指标：\n- 代码围栏数是否为奇数（代码被截断）\n- 是否以标题开头（脱离小节上下文）\n- 是否几乎纯代码而无中文说明\n并给出处理建议（调高 DIFY_MAX_TOKENS 或在源笔记拆分过长章节）。","tree":{"sha":"d5f019323c42d656ec272ad968cd69ab9831b730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/d5f019323c42d656ec272ad968cd69ab9831b730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDIxODIzN2QzNjE4NzE1NGU2NzBlZmFmMmQ2Y2IzODEzYTM1NDczYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8","sha":"e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8"}],"sha":"218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/218237d36187154e670efaf2d6cb3813a35473c0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:37:22Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:37:22Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"docs(dify): 整合排查段落，给出应用侧核对清单与判定方法\n\n补充一条决定性的判定手段：用笔记里独有的词提问（如 LCEMonitor，模型\n不可能凭空知道）。若回答「暂时还不清楚」，说明知识库内容根本没送到\n模型；这能把「模型靠常识蒙对」与「知识库真的生效」区分开。","tree":{"sha":"01c8fd0e0ddb85c4eb9b005913efaa409f7fa7e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/01c8fd0e0ddb85c4eb9b005913efaa409f7fa7e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGU3ZWI4ZmIzZTE0NzRkMTg3NzVmZWYzMDIzN2UyMzc1ZTk4YzdiZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8","sha":"827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8"}],"sha":"e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/e7eb8fb3e1474d18775fef30237e2375e98c7bd8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:33:19Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:33:19Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"docs(dify): 补充「知识库直查有结果、应用却答不出来」的排查路径\n\n本次排查花了较多时间才定位到：知识库的检索设置与应用「编排 → 上下文」\n里的检索设置是两套独立配置，改一个不一定影响另一个，而知识库自带的\n「召回测试」只反映知识库侧设置，所以它通过并不代表应用侧能召回。\n\n文档固化了几条已验证的事实：\n- 该知识库所有分段都不生成 keywords（--probe 实测 automatic 与 custom\n  三种模式均为 0），因此应用侧检索方式选「关键词检索」必然召回 0 条\n- 知识库实测分数约 0.67，应用侧若把分数阈值设为 0.9 会把结果全过滤掉\n- 重排序模型不可用会导致检索整体失败","tree":{"sha":"29799761d866fba7b3a23e8a77653ab6c3341098","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/29799761d866fba7b3a23e8a77653ab6c3341098"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDgyN2FlMjBiYWY3YTA1YWYzODYyYzQ4MjBmZWVkZmZiNDJjNDYwZDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e","sha":"5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e"}],"sha":"827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/827ae20baf7a05af3862c4820feedffb42c460d8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:31:15Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:31:15Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 自检显示各检索方式耗时，便于判断是否超时\n\n应用侧持续召回 0 条，而知识库直查能召回 9 条。混合检索叠加重排序后\n在 CI 上出现过超时（The operation was aborted due to timeout），\n耗时数据可帮助判断应用侧是否因超时而静默返回空。\n\n同时补充结论分支：全文索引不可用但向量可用时，建议应用侧改用纯向量\n检索并关闭重排序。","tree":{"sha":"73cc7a832cc5377f20b4c4787ced10bbc398b3bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/73cc7a832cc5377f20b4c4787ced10bbc398b3bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDVkZGRiODdlZDZkZDc1NmIwZTYwMTk5ZjJhODM5OThiYmJlYzFlOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18","sha":"c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18"}],"sha":"5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5dddb87ed6dd756b0e60199f2a83998bbbec1e9e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:16:34Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:16:34Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): --probe 增加 keywords 探针，验证自定义分段规则是否抑制全文索引\n\n--audit 发现全部 1977 个分段的 keywords 都是 null，keyword_search 必然\n召回 0 条。需区分两种可能：自定义 process_rule 抑制了关键词提取，还是\n该知识库本就不生成 keywords。\n\n探针用同一段内容分别以 automatic / custom(CHUNK_MARKER) / custom(空行)\n三种模式创建临时文档，比对各自的分段数与 keywords 数量，据此给出结论\n与处理方向（改用 automatic，或把应用侧检索改为向量/混合检索）。","tree":{"sha":"19ea34d7ed57bec6b49f1b0c11a1e2ca50511276","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/19ea34d7ed57bec6b49f1b0c11a1e2ca50511276"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGM5M2FkNzJiYjI0MzczOTM2MmI5OWM0Y2M3NzI4YzYxODI2ZDRiMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627","sha":"42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627"}],"sha":"c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/c93ad72bb243739362b99c4cc7728c61826d4b18"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:08:31Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:08:31Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --audit 审核分段 keywords，定位 keyword_search 召回 0\n\n自检发现一个异常：keyword_search 召回 0 条（此前它是唯一可用的方式），\n而向量与混合检索都正常。全文检索依赖分段的 keywords 字段，若所有分段\n都没有 keywords，keyword_search 必然召回 0 条。\n\n--audit 逐个文档打印索引状态、分段数、带 keywords 的分段数，并采样\n无 keywords 的分段；若全部分段都缺 keywords，提示把应用侧检索方式\n改为向量检索，或把混合权重调为纯向量。","tree":{"sha":"3ed4707285f1b2a6655c164c4f0df244a365b59f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/3ed4707285f1b2a6655c164c4f0df244a365b59f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDQyZDE2MGU2NjRiZjBjOGE3NjcyZmQ1ODIwNzQ5NDhjMjU1MmI2Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95","sha":"bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95"}],"sha":"42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/42d160e664bf0c8a7672fd582074948c2552b627"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:06:04Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:06:04Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 自检增加重排序测试，定位「直查有结果、应用却为空」\n\n模型的思考过程里明确说「上下文 context 为空」，但直查 API 能召回 9 条\n（Top1 0.6745）——说明知识库侧正常，问题出在应用侧检索设置上。\n\n知识库配置里 reranking_mode 是 \"reranking_model\" 且指定了 qwen3-rerank，\n但 reranking_enable 为 false。若应用侧单独开启了重排序而该模型不可用，\n检索就会返回空，正好解释「直查有结果、应用上下文为空」。\n\n自检现在额外测一次「混合检索 + 重排序」：不开能召回、开了失败，即锁定\n为重排序模型问题，并给出应用侧的关闭路径。","tree":{"sha":"a5c8132d27def63999d5e4edd2e3cbc73bdf954c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/a5c8132d27def63999d5e4edd2e3cbc73bdf954c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGJmNmJmYzRkMWU0YmU2ZDAzYWU4Y2Q5MjFhYWE0YTIwZjYxYzNmOTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf","sha":"106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf"}],"sha":"bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/bf6bfc4d1e4be6d03ae8cd921aaa4a20f61c3f95"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:02:02Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:02:02Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --datasets 列出全部知识库，核对应用绑定\n\n直查 API 已能召回（Top1 0.6745），但应用侧仍召回 0 条。需先排除\n「应用关联的知识库」与「脚本同步的知识库」不是同一个的情况。","tree":{"sha":"ff40133de6d3981dcd37f64b63fc63c79cf31eaf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/ff40133de6d3981dcd37f64b63fc63c79cf31eaf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDEwNjk0MWJjM2Y5NTJiZTgwZDYwMjFhYWJkMjRmNzRjNjYyZDVmZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3","sha":"65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3"}],"sha":"106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/106941bc3f952be80d6021aabd24f74c662d5fdf"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:44:32Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:44:32Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): --probe 增加向量索引自检，区分两种失败模式\n\n诊断显示「关键词检索可用、向量检索报 Collection not found」。\n但两种截然不同的原因都可能导致这个现象，处理方式完全相反：\n\n  A) embedding 模型不可用 → 新建的文档也建不了向量\n     必须换一个知识库并选用可用的 embedding 模型\n  B) 旧文档缺向量、索引机制本身正常 → 全量重新同步即可修复\n\n--probe 现在会用刚创建的临时文档做检索试验：若新文档能被向量检索\n召回，则为 B；若同样失败，则为 A。据此给出对应的处理步骤。","tree":{"sha":"8e7209c9785bb128162ba57c0772a92fb6c8e6e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/8e7209c9785bb128162ba57c0772a92fb6c8e6e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDY1Y2RiNjE0YzVlOTE2MTM1M2U2NDNkZWRiMGU1ZDY3ODZmOWFmZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3","sha":"b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3"}],"sha":"65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/65cdb614c5e9161353e643dedb0e5d6786f9afe3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:42:21Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:42:21Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): --dataset 分别测试三种检索方式，定位向量索引缺失\n\n切到混合检索后召回归零，且直查 API 报 \"Collection not found\"。\n现在分别用 keyword_search / semantic_search / hybrid_search 各检索一次：\n若关键词可用而向量失败，即为向量索引缺失（embedding 模型变更后未重建\n索引的典型症状），并给出重建步骤。","tree":{"sha":"c3b3000f108599198c504f399e82f954016607c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/c3b3000f108599198c504f399e82f954016607c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGI2ZDdiMTRhMGJiNjgwOTMxMzM4NTkxODU2ODJkODIxN2I0OGIyYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661","sha":"92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661"}],"sha":"b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/b6d7b14a0bb68093133859185682d8217b48b2c3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:40:50Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T08:40:50Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): --dataset 增加自检检索，识别召回为 0 的配置问题\n\n切换到混合检索后实测召回变成 0 条（回答全是「不清楚」）。--dataset\n现在会打印原始 retrieval_model_dict，并用固定问题直接检索一次，\n区分「配置变了但没生效」与「配置本身把结果全过滤掉了」。","tree":{"sha":"21b1ba564913ea59726cd2459d59d9dec728b0ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/21b1ba564913ea59726cd2459d59d9dec728b0ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDkyYzgxYmMxNjUwNTlmNTNkYTA4NThkN2VhNDE3MzI3Y2Q4M2I2NjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7","sha":"ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7"}],"sha":"92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/92c81bc165059f53da0858d7ea417327cd83b661"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:55:37Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:55:37Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): --dataset 诊断出检索方式为关键词检索，指出召回不佳的根因\n\n--dataset 打印知识库配置，实测揭晓了「同一问题时对时错」的真正原因：\n\n  检索方式  keyword_search   ← 纯字面匹配，没有语义理解\n  重排序    未开启\n  Top K     2               ← 只召回 2 个分段，容错空间极小\n  embedding 多模态模型\n\n关键词检索是主因：笔记里写「@Module() 装饰器」，用这个词能命中；\n但用户问「模块怎么定义」时词面对不上，就召回不到或召回错。这也解释了\n为什么原句匹配（「模块是组织应用的基本单元」）会跑到微前端文档去。\n\n诊断输出现在会逐项指出问题与对应的控制台操作路径，并给出 Top K 过小\n的提示。这些属于知识库/应用配置，需要到 Dify 控制台调整。","tree":{"sha":"86a3a0883ef1b61be92c1b9bc41327cc1992d92a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/86a3a0883ef1b61be92c1b9bc41327cc1992d92a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/ad5e412ebe3c85445967124de71cc5be0eec3fa7","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGFkNWU0MTJlYmUzYzg1NDQ1OTY3MTI0ZGU3MWNjNWJlMGVlYzNmYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/6366fffef4270b689b20185f969f8b9af649adba","sha":"6366fffef4