encent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:50:08Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(ci): 工作流支持 retrieve 直查召回","tree":{"sha":"30cbf62f03a6a0094de8a61e93bdb4f5dfbbea82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/30cbf62f03a6a0094de8a61e93bdb4f5dfbbea82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/23ceadf1de0844dcadfa8527b7b7514d5143215e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/23ceadf1de0844dcadfa8527b7b7514d5143215e","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDIzY2VhZGYxZGUwODQ0ZGNhZGZhODUyN2I3Yjc1MTRkNTE0MzIxNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da","sha":"d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da"}],"sha":"23ceadf1de0844dcadfa8527b7b7514d5143215e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/23ceadf1de0844dcadfa8527b7b7514d5143215e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:49:59Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:49:59Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --retrieve 直查知识库召回，隔离验证 chunk 质量\n\n线上问答不稳定（同一问题 1/4 次答对），需要区分是知识库内容问题还是\n应用侧配置问题（问题优化改写查询 / 重排序 / Top K）。\n\n--retrieve 直接用 Dataset API Key 调 /datasets/{id}/retrieve，绕开应用\n侧的查询改写，打印每次召回的分段路径、内容与分数，并给出结论：\nTop1 分数偏低（<0.4）时提示向量模型对中文区分度不足，可更换 embedding\n模型或开启重排序。","tree":{"sha":"ece35adf8fde4fea3c54cdbdb0b3d01a69524e1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/ece35adf8fde4fea3c54cdbdb0b3d01a69524e1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGQwOTI3ZDA2OTFhMTY3OTk0YTVhYTY0ODAyNzU5ZmNhYzBkZmY3ZGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5","sha":"ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5"}],"sha":"d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/d0927d0691a167994a5aa64802759fcac0dff7da"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:43:49Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:43:49Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): chunk 补标题路径，修复「关键词黑洞」挤掉答案\n\n实测发现同一个问题（NestJS 的模块怎么定义）答案不稳定，时对时错。\n抓取召回片段看到分数断层：\n\n  #1 score=0.3782  NestJS 学习路线（ASCII 花框图，789 字）\n  #2 score=0.0827  小结\n  #3 score=0.0810  跨模块注入\n  #4 score=0.0793  tsconfig 配置\n\n那张路线图把 模块/控制器/服务/依赖注入/GraphQL 等词全塞在一起，\n任何 NestJS 问题都能高度匹配，却装不下具体答案，稳定的占据第一，\n把真正含 @Module() 代码的 chunk 挤出名额。\n\n由于 Dify 应用提示词要求「仅依据知识库内容作答」，检索不到就答不出来。\n\n现在每个 chunk 都带上标题路径：\n  【NestJS-01-项目与模块 > 3.1 @Module() 装饰器】\n  ### 3.1 @Module() 装饰器\n  ...\n让片段脱离文档后仍能自述出处，向量与关键词匹配都更准，也便于 AI\n判断片段与问题的相关性。\n\n分片由「整篇一次性粗化」改为「每篇笔记单独粗化后拼接」，否则分片标题\n会成为所有 chunk 的路径首段，丢失「属于哪篇笔记」这一层信息。\n\n实测含 @Module 的 chunk（347 字）完整包含 import、@Module({...})、\nexport class；124 个 chunk 全部带标题路径。","tree":{"sha":"304a11ed0de8f8169f19fdefde1041b243226cae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/304a11ed0de8f8169f19fdefde1041b243226cae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGJhMGQwZTNmNjIyNmQwMGNkNWM2ZThjMGI4NjhmYjRjZGQ5NTVkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba","sha":"5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba"}],"sha":"ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/ba0d0e3f6226d00cd5c6e8c0b868fb4cdd955db5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:30:28Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:30:28Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 改用自定义分隔符，代码块不再被从中间切开\n\n节点实测发现：用 \\n\\n 作 separator 时，Dify 只按 separator 切分且不合并，\n于是代码块内的空行也成了切分点——含 `@Module() 装饰器` 的章节被切成两半，\n`import { Module }` 与 `@Module({` 分别落进相邻两个 chunk，两边都无法独立\n回答「模块怎么定义」。\n\n改用正文中绝不会出现的标记作 separator：\n  \\n\\n<<<DIFY-SECTION>>>\n这样既能完整保留代码块空行与缩进，又让 chunk 边界精确落在章节之间。\n分隔符在切分时被移除，不会进入 chunk 内容。\n\n同时把 remove_extra_spaces 关掉，避免 Dify 预处理破坏代码块缩进。\n\n实测（NestJS 分片，含 @Module 的章节）：\n  修复前：`import { Module }` 与 `@Module({` 被切到两个 chunk\n  修复后：单个 309 字 chunk 完整包含 import、@Module({...})、export class\n\n全库：1344 块，平均 604 字，中位 410 字，<50 字仅 2 块（0%）","tree":{"sha":"cf4fb39d2909c8c2579c620cba7fae6d2e540191","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/cf4fb39d2909c8c2579c620cba7fae6d2e540191"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDVhMjA5YWI1ZDI1ZTQ4Y2E3MGUzMGEzZmRkZWFhZjkzNzIyNWNkYmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324","sha":"9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324"}],"sha":"5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/5a209ab5d25e48ca70e30a3fddeaaf937225cdba"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:19:50Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:19:50Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 合并过短章节，碎片率 14% → 2%\n\n上一轮粗化后仍留下 32 个 6 字碎片，形如「二、项目结构」「二、基本用法」——\n这些章节后面直接跟子标题，去掉空行后只剩标题本身，单独成块没有任何\n信息量，却仍可能与问题词面重合而被检索命中。\n\ncoarsenForChunking 增加 minChars 阈值（默认 120 字）：过短的章节用单换行\n并入下一节。必须用单换行而非空行拼接，否则又会被 separator 切开。末尾\n过短的章节则并入前一节。\n\nNestJS 单篇实测（与 --inspect 同口径）：\n  分段数   371 → 225 → 169\n  平均长度 84 字 → 140 字 → 197 字\n  <50 字   43% → 14% → 2%","tree":{"sha":"0382ae00d978c9da9f021f97f3fc0a0257b37950","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/0382ae00d978c9da9f021f97f3fc0a0257b37950"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDllYmU0MDk1YWIxZTJlYWY3NDllYTQwMjRkNWFkZGQ5YjFiYjMzMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613","sha":"fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613"}],"sha":"9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9ebe4095ab1e2eaf749ea4024d5addd9b1bb3324"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:13:25Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:13:25Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 从输入文本侧粗化分段，修复检索命中碎片\n\n--probe 给出了决定性证据（三个 separator 分别得到 3/5/1 段，与预期完全\n一致）：process_rule 确实生效，但 Dify 严格按 separator 切分且不合并\n相邻块，max_tokens 只是「超长才强制切分」的上限，不是合并目标。\n\n所以上一轮传入 max_tokens: 800 完全无效——NestJS 分片仍是 371 段。\n要得到粗分段，只能减少输入文本里 separator（\\n\\n）的出现次数。\n\n新增 coarsenForChunking()：以 H1-H3 标题为章节边界，删掉同一章节内部\n段落之间的空行（代码块内的空行完整保留），使 \\n\\n 只落在章节边界上，\n让每个 chunk 与章节对齐。\n\n实测（模拟 Dify 按 \\n\\n 切分）：\n  块数      6734 → 3533\n  平均长度  119 字 → 227 字\n  <50 字    40% → 15%\n  53 个代码块中有 33 个含空行，全部保留","tree":{"sha":"7ade9ff04fc3197457551f27eb49e5721e1dfd00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/7ade9ff04fc3197457551f27eb49e5721e1dfd00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGZhYjUwNjE3NzExNTU4NDNhYjU3MWY0YjBjMzcxMjM3NWNhZGI2MTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578","sha":"9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578"}],"sha":"fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/fab5061771155843ab571f4b0c3712375cadb613"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:09:44Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:09:44Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(ci): 工作流支持 probe 分段探测","tree":{"sha":"5ac163faf1dc922a6a1a88dfc767e4da83849343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/5ac163faf1dc922a6a1a88dfc767e4da83849343"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDllOTRkN2ExOWU2OGUyN2NhMDc5Yzk3MWNhNDUxZWJhNTE0YWY1Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2","sha":"de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2"}],"sha":"9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/9e94d7a19e68e27ca079c971ca451eba514af578"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:09:22Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:09:22Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --probe 探测分段规则是否真正生效\n\n上一轮改用 custom 分段规则后，NestJS 分片的分段数依然是 371（与\nautomatic 时完全一致），说明要么 process_rule 未被接受、要么 Dify\n切分后并不合并相邻块。两者需要区分清楚才能对症下药。\n\n--probe 用同一段内容（5 个非空行、3 个空行分隔的块）配三种 separator\n创建临时文档：\n  separator = \"\\n\\n\" → 预期 3 段\n  separator = \"\\n\"   → 预期 5 段\n  separator = \"🦄\"   → 预期 1 段\n若三者段数相同，说明 process_rule 未生效；若逐一不同，说明生效且\n不合并，需要从输入文本侧减少分隔符。探测完自动删除临时文档。","tree":{"sha":"b6cfb280cb56fc2ae2dd06b1e806dfbc41aaee0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/b6cfb280cb56fc2ae2dd06b1e806dfbc41aaee0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGRlMDZkODQwZTk3Y2FlYzZiZWFhMDQzYTMyZjhmNzRmODhhNmVjYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0","sha":"1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0"}],"sha":"de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/de06d840e97caec6beaa043a32f8f74f88a6eca2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:02:51Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:02:51Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 改用 custom 分段规则，修复检索命中碎片而非答案\n\n用 --inspect 实测发现 Dify 默认把每个空行段落直接当成一个独立 chunk，\n不做任何合并。以 NestJS 分片为例：\n\n  分段数 371 | 平均 84 字 | 最短 4 字 | 最长 535 字\n  <50 字占 43%（最短的段落是「18. 测试」「官方资源」这种标题碎片）\n\n本地按空行切分得到的段落数（371）与平均长度（89 字）与 Dify 报告的\n数据吻合，确认了「一个空行段落 = 一个 chunk」这一机制。这就是「命中了\n片段但 AI 答不出来」的原因——碎片与问题词面重合度高，却装不下答案。\n\n现在显式传入 process_rule（mode=custom）：\n- separator 用 \\n\\n，max_tokens 默认 800（可用 DIFY_MAX_TOKENS 调整）\n- 开启 remove_extra_spaces，关闭 remove_urls_emails 以保留文档链接\n- 让相邻段落向上合并，使每个 chunk 自带完整上下文\n\n--inspect 同时增加结论提示：碎片占比超过 25% 时给出重新同步的建议。","tree":{"sha":"b2b28eeef098148d35ffa6d44e25c20e9dd8d8aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/b2b28eeef098148d35ffa6d44e25c20e9dd8d8aa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDFjMzliNjQxMTY4MmE2Y2I4YTZjMTYzZmY2YTIyOWE5MTYzZDU4ZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c","sha":"64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c"}],"sha":"1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/1c39b6411682a6cb8a6c163ff6a229a9163d58f0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:00:01Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T07:00:01Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(ci): 工作流支持 inspect 诊断模式","tree":{"sha":"76219722102e5d1fdf49ed67948642b1788fe5e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/76219722102e5d1fdf49ed67948642b1788fe5e1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDY0ZGI1OTk2MDIzYzFjZWM5MDJiNGNjMDE3N2M3M2I2NmU1YmZjNGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed","sha":"95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed"}],"sha":"64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/64db5996023c1cec902b4cc0177c73b66e5bfc4c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:59:52Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:59:52Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"feat(dify): 新增 --inspect 诊断分段明细\n\n「命中片段却答不出来」需要先看清 Dify 实际把文档切成了什么，\n再决定是调分段规则还是改输入文本。\n\n--inspect 通过 API 导出各文档的分段数、平均/最短/最长长度、\n最长的 3 段与最短的 5 段，以及全库分段长度分布直方图。\n\n用法：\n  node scripts/sync-to-dify.mjs --inspect\n  node scripts/sync-to-dify.mjs --inspect=NestJS","tree":{"sha":"b7d4abecf4a42481f4fffbfe8da6226c5ea007f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/b7d4abecf4a42481f4fffbfe8da6226c5ea007f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDk1YjQyOGJhOTgzNTZjMDk5MzM1ODNkMjU4ZDczY2QwYTdjZDJiZWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442","sha":"39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442"}],"sha":"95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/95b428ba98356c09933583d258d73cd0a7cd2bed"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:53:24Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:53:33Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 剔除 Obsidian 噪音行，修复「命中片段却答不出来」\n\n实测发现：问「NestJS 的模块怎么定义」时命中 4 条片段(score 0.59)，\nAI 却回答「暂时还不清楚」——命中的全是标签行与导航行：\n  #NestJS #基础 #模块                           (14 字)\n  NestJS-01-项目与模块                          (15 字)\n  返回 NestJS学习路线 | 上一章 ... | 下一章 ...  (60 字)\n\n这些行与问题词面重合度极高，向量检索会排到最前，但信息量为零，\n把真正讲解正文的片段挤出了名额。\n\nscripts/lib/dify-shard.mjs 新增 stripObsidianNoise()：\n- 删除 Obsidian 标签行（靠 # 后无空格与 markdown 标题区分）\n- 删除笔记间跳转条（上一章/下一章，以及「返回 X | ...」形式）\n- 折叠多余空行、去掉单独成段的分隔线\n- 代码块内一律保留，避免误删代码注释与 shebang\n\n分片组装不再插分隔线，并在笔记自带 H1 时跳过重复标题。\n\n实测：标签行 44→0、导航行 41→0、分隔线 762→0，代码注释完整保留。","tree":{"sha":"866f7c3e563f6bce16d4d168697c170b9090267c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/866f7c3e563f6bce16d4d168697c170b9090267c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKDM5YjhhOWRkYWQ0NjhjYmRjYjc4YzljM2Y5NzExMzg3YmNkY2U0NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9","sha":"dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9"}],"sha":"39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/39b8a9ddad468cbdcb78c9c3f9711387bcdce442"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:38:49Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:38:49Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 修正索引核验阶段把数组当 Map 迭代导致的崩溃\n\nresult.touched 是 [batch, name][] 数组，直接传给 verifyIndexing 后\n在其内部 new Map(batches) 时抛错「Iterator value ... is not an entry object」，\n使同步在最后一步以 exit 1 收场。改为原样传递并在打印时构造查找表。","tree":{"sha":"8fea819e970994fae8fbb072452c96c57c463d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/8fea819e970994fae8fbb072452c96c57c463d46"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGRlZGMyZWM4ZmVkNTM4ODk3NGQwYzhiMmNiMDg5OWQzYTgwYzgyZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5bdc","sha":"289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5bdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5bdc"}],"sha":"dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/dedc2ec8fed5388974d0c8b2cb0899d3a80c82d9"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5bdc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:35:54Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:35:54Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): indexing-status 需传 batch ID 而非 document ID\n\nDify 的 GET /datasets/{id}/documents/{batch}/indexing-status 接收创建/更新\n返回的 batch ID，传 document ID 会得到 404 Documents not found，导致索引\n核验阶段把所有文档误报为异常。改为记录并使用 batch ID。","tree":{"sha":"67274fd99fe1e1d410f10ac3e5e833f16948e2b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/67274fd99fe1e1d410f10ac3e5e833f16948e2b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5bdc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/289791d3a9c667e2c6c675bd59c7e5186c6b5b