b15763dd94c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commits/da689ff7e245fd332a1fc14b7c36404292034588/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:25:15Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:25:15Z","email":"jiahaoqian@tencent.com","name":"jiahaoqian"},"message":"fix(dify): 知识库同步改为幂等增量 + 分片，规避免费版配额\n\n同步脚本此前对每个文件都调 create_by_file，第二次运行必然报\n\"document already exists\" 并 exit 1，导致三次工作流全部失败、知识库始终为空。\n\n- scripts/sync-to-dify.mjs 重写：\n  * 幂等：按文档名匹配远端，已存在则 update-by-text，否则 create-by-text\n  * 分片：默认按叶子目录合并同系列笔记（90 篇 → 18 篇），规避免费版\n    「50 个知识库文档」配额；--no-merge 可切回逐篇\n  * 限流：默认 6500ms 间隔（约 9 次/分钟），适配免费版 10 次/分钟限制\n  * 增量：--changed-since=<git ref> 只同步改动过的文件\n  * 可核验：同步后轮询 indexing-status，索引失败如实报错而非静默通过\n  * 双链归一化：[[目标|别名]] → 别名，避免检索片段夹带语法噪音\n- scripts/lib/dify-shard.mjs：分片规则抽为共享模块\n- scripts/generate-doc-map.mjs：映射表补充分片名，保证 AI 引用的文档可跳转\n- .github/workflows/sync-dify.yml：修复用 `echo $?` 判断导致永远成功的假成功逻辑，\n  增加 mode/merge/prune/dry_run 选项与 Secrets 预校验\n- DIFY_SETUP.md / .env.example：修正过时内容（dify-config.js 不生效、配额、\n  模型下线排查），补充凭据类型区分说明","tree":{"sha":"b29b4b1aced2b3eb7d060b45a832f9c195c18af2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/trees/b29b4b1aced2b3eb7d060b45a832f9c195c18af2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/git/commits/da689ff7e245fd332a1fc14b7c36404292034588","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/da689ff7e245fd332a1fc14b7c36404292034588","node_id":"C_kwDOMrkYk9oAKGRhNjg5ZmY3ZTI0NWZkMzMyYTFmYzE0YjdjMzY0MDQyOTIwMzQ1ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-space/commit/d3d43027ce96bc08bec4c7d812483d9846654585","sha":"d3d43027ce96bc08bec4c7d812483d9846654585","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoneyFool9/docs-luoye-spac