2518033bffb323187a1821e3d","sha":"b3229127123615c2518033bffb323187a1821e3d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/b3229127123615c2518033bffb323187a1821e3d"}],"sha":"027bc237e29d26b6dc9fcef5bb7ddaca47fa443e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/027bc237e29d26b6dc9fcef5bb7ddaca47fa443e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/b3229127123615c2518033bffb323187a1821e3d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:06:38Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:06:38Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(ci): eliminate vite ESM require() race in Nx project graph processing\n\nRename ui/tucu-ui''s vite.config.ts, vite.config.styles.ts and\nvitest.config.ts to .mts. ui/tucu-ui/package.json has no \"type\":\n\"module\", so Vite bundled these configs to CJS and require()d them;\nrequire() of the ESM-only @tailwindcss/vite (which statically imports\n''vite'') raced against the Nx plugin workers'' concurrent dynamic\nimport(''vite'') during graph processing, intermittently failing CI with\n\"Cannot require() ES Module vite/dist/node/index.js because it is not\nyet fully loaded\" (seen in v2.8.2 release and twice on 2026-08-18).\n\nAs .mts the configs always load as ESM, so no require() path into the\nvite module graph exists and the race is structurally impossible —\nunlike NX_ISOLATE_PLUGINS / NX_DAEMON=false (don''t address the\nintra-worker race) or upgrading nx (23.1.1 ships the same per-module\npreload workarounds as 22.7.7, none covering @tailwindcss/vite).\n\nVerified: 5x cold-cache graph processing, nx build tucu-ui-mcp,\nnx build tucu-ui, nx test tucu-ui — all green; test target still\ninferred for tucu-ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77c82be4aa00779746ea4ef183dead2a9ab79c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/77c82be4aa00779746ea4ef183dead2a9ab79c2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/b3229127123615c2518033bffb323187a1821e3d","verification":{"payload":"tree 77c82be4aa00779746ea4ef183dead2a9ab79c2f\nparent da31bd6654a28ba7f81cda4c299557f0b8dd33b8\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1787090798 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1787090798 -0300\n\nfix(ci): eliminate vite ESM require() race in Nx project graph processing\n\nRename ui/tucu-ui''s vite.config.ts, vite.config.styles.ts and\nvitest.config.ts to .mts. ui/tucu-ui/package.json has no \"type\":\n\"module\", so Vite bundled these configs to CJS and require()d them;\nrequire() of the ESM-only @tailwindcss/vite (which statically imports\n''vite'') raced against the Nx plugin workers'' concurrent dynamic\nimport(''vite'') during graph processing, intermittently failing CI with\n\"Cannot require() ES Module vite/dist/node/index.js because it is not\nyet fully loaded\" (seen in v2.8.2 release and twice on 2026-08-18).\n\nAs .mts the configs always load as ESM, so no require() path into the\nvite module graph exists and the race is structurally impossible —\nunlike NX_ISOLATE_PLUGINS / NX_DAEMON=false (don''t address the\nintra-worker race) or upgrading nx (23.1.1 ships the same per-module\npreload workarounds as 22.7.7, none covering @tailwindcss/vite).\n\nVerified: 5x cold-cache graph processing, nx build tucu-ui-mcp,\nnx build tucu-ui, nx test tucu-ui — all green; test target still\ninferred for tucu-ui.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQF5TKa5jCovE3QeD5Xt7deyqFoiuWWh8P0GnWsCdhFsSz0FVO314sBl/mX8lTW5naC\nLdCdrAH4wtbjBbdIyMHAg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T22:17:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/b3229127123615c2518033bffb323187a1821e3d","node_id":"