,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/d63ee9cb1a7a7ab6e4d5b199b7891a9a83eb84e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:03:57Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T22:03:57Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(docs): align tucu-docs dependency on @e-burgos/tucu-ui to ^3.1.0\n\ntucu-docs declared ^2.6.0, so pnpm resolved a SECOND copy of the library\n(2.6.0) for the docs pages while the demo shell used 3.1.0. Every docs\nsection importing from ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui'' — including the new Sidebar\nPinning demo — rendered against the 2.6.0 copy on the deployed site: no\npin API, no edge toggle, no collapsedLogo swap. Aligning the range makes\npnpm resolve a single 3.1.0 instance for both importers.\n\nVerified: demo build bundles only the 3.1.0 sidebar code, and the live\ndemo page now renders the edge toggle and the per-state brand swap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4daf9d04d25a8858980b8f767a94db747118f483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/4daf9d04d25a8858980b8f767a94db747118f483"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/d63ee9cb1a7a7ab6e4d5b199b7891a9a83eb84e4","verification":{"payload":"tree 4daf9d04d25a8858980b8f767a94db747118f483\nparent da31bd6654a28ba7f81cda4c299557f0b8dd33b8\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1787090637 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1787090637 -0300\n\nfix(docs): align tucu-docs dependency on @e-burgos/tucu-ui to ^3.1.0\n\ntucu-docs declared ^2.6.0, so pnpm resolved a SECOND copy of the library\n(2.6.0) for the docs pages while the demo shell used 3.1.0. Every docs\nsection importing from ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui'' — including the new Sidebar\nPinning demo — rendered against the 2.6.0 copy on the deployed site: no\npin API, no edge toggle, no collapsedLogo swap. Aligning the range makes\npnpm resolve a single 3.1.0 instance for both importers.\n\nVerified: demo build bundles only the 3.1.0 sidebar code, and the live\ndemo page now renders the edge toggle and the per-state brand swap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQK/r9o8RZO+7lW/xOCv7eMnHcbYuJ6esdvYHWwbV/YpEA1xFtgaKdClBJ/SjuWW6ut\nNKYRTO5R9n9PAzCKsLhgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T22:04:01Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/d63ee9cb1a7a7ab6e4d5b199b7891a9a83eb84e4","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKGQ2M2VlOWN