the demo''s dependency from ^2.8.1 to ^3.0.0 and add the new opt-in\n`@e-burgos/tucu-ui/fonts` entry — the theme entry deliberately ships no\nfonts in 3.0.0, and the demo is the sanity check for the real npm package.\n\nVerified against the published artifact: build green, and the compiled\nstylesheet now carries the DataTable `--color-table-*` tokens and carousel\nskin that `./theme` consumers were missing before 3.0.0, with the four\nvariable fonts emitted as woff2 files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7a3a4e3381698bd37d3010b52aeba7358d0266a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/a7a3a4e3381698bd37d3010b52aeba7358d0266a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/dec7feecfc883697c9e414ef84cc0a9a54082282","verification":{"payload":"tree a7a3a4e3381698bd37d3010b52aeba7358d0266a\nparent c8bef647a41ee89cea4344cd83101dd794c8434a\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785610157 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785610157 -0300\n\nchore(demo): consume published tucu-ui 3.0.0 and load the bundled fonts\n\nBump the demo''s dependency from ^2.8.1 to ^3.0.0 and add the new opt-in\n`@e-burgos/tucu-ui/fonts` entry — the theme entry deliberately ships no\nfonts in 3.0.0, and the demo is the sanity check for the real npm package.\n\nVerified against the published artifact: build green, and the compiled\nstylesheet now carries the DataTable `--color-table-*` tokens and carousel\nskin that `./theme` consumers were missing before 3.0.0, with the four\nvariable fonts emitted as woff2 files.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPxjUuMnT7we7Tp0jGSV8Bb80swOa/5W2VtW5iBwaUOjz7RyArVn0MaYz0wd2Ti0pU\nAve5E