comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/625df411a1f53382fd6e23d4dbd9b8701f8f906f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T18:17:55Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T18:17:55Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"docs(mcp): add from-scratch app setup, backgrounds and persistence\n\nThe quickstart resource now walks an agent through configuring a brand-new\nVite app end to end: scaffold, dependencies, the vite config for the\nown-Tailwind path, CSS entry choice, main.tsx and a ThemeProvider App —\nplus how settings persistence works (theme-storage key, per-variant\nconfigs) and the pin-vs-persist semantics of the mode/layout/background\nprops, which silently override saved user preferences on every load.\n\nThe theme resource gains a Backgrounds section (all backgroundVariant\nvalues, CSS-only vs CDN-image variants, ThemeBackground standalone usage,\nself-hosting via cdnBase) and a Persistence section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8166777a1c6d2b82978dea9dda3bc85c5c791b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/f8166777a1c6d2b82978dea9dda3bc85c5c791b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/625df411a1f53382fd6e23d4dbd9b8701f8f906f","verification":{"payload":"tree f8166777a1c6d2b82978dea9dda3bc85c5c791b8\nparent 634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785608275 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785608275 -0300\n\ndocs(mcp): add from-scratch app setup, backgrounds and persistence\n\nThe quickstart resource now walks an agent through configuring a brand-new\nVite app end to end: scaffold, dependencies, the vite config for the\nown-Tailwind path, CSS entry choice, main.tsx and a ThemeProvider App —\nplus how settings persistence works (theme-storage key, per-variant\nconfigs) and the pin-vs-persist semantics of the mode/layout/background\nprops, which silently override saved user preferences on every load.\n\nThe theme resource gains a Backgrounds section (all backgroundVariant\nvalues, CSS-only vs CDN-image variants, ThemeBackground standalone usage,\nself-hosting via cdnBase) and a Persistence section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQP93mcFVDeiU4ukeTEDbY7mSCX2FGSbUObSdEELWQzWah5DGU3Zmi5b1uHckVNYnYE\nEQLeMRYAdEJcCINExz2w0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/625df411a1f53382fd6e23d4dbd9b8701f8f906f","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKDYyNWRmNDExYTFmNTMzODJmZDZlMjNkNGRiZDliODcwMWY4ZjkwNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d","sha":"634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d"}],"sha":"625df411a1f53382fd6e23d4dbd9b8701f8f906f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/625df411a1f53382fd6e23d4dbd9b8701f8f906f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T18:17:55Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T18:17:55Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(ui): show cached background images after a full refresh\n\nPicking an image background (wave/wallpaper/mobile — the macOS SVG\nvariants) worked live but the image vanished on every full refresh, even\nthough the store, localStorage and the rendered variant were all correct.\n\nReproduced in a real browser: after reload the <img> reported\ncomplete=true / naturalWidth>0 yet still carried opacity-0. On a refresh\nthe SVG comes from the browser cache and finishes loading before React\nattaches the onLoad handler, so the load event never reaches the\ncomponent, imgLoaded stays false and the fade-in never runs. Picking a\nbackground live always worked because the first fetch is slow enough for\nthe handler to be attached.\n\nCheck the element through a ref after every commit that can swap the src:\nalready-complete images with dimensions are marked loaded immediately, and\ncomplete images with no dimensions are treated as failed so the broken\nimage element is removed.\n\nRegression coverage: cached-image tests for ThemeBackground (mocking\nHTMLImageElement.prototype.complete) plus a store persistence suite that\nsimulates full reloads with vi.resetModules — pick, reload, re-run the\nwrapper mount effect, assert the choice survives across schemes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24ddad4e446668a5ddbc5a648969dbea8e49d342","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/24ddad4e446668a5ddbc5a648969dbea8e49d342"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/634ebfbcc9563e6a32920033f9a569c8a4a80e7d","verification":{"payload":"tree 24ddad4e446668a5ddbc5a648969dbea8e49d342\nparent c3d02c19e7dc4060e596b6a81382b9c47473e90d\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785608275 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785608275 -0300\n\nfix(ui): show cached background images after a full refresh\n\nPicking an image background (wave/wallpaper/mobile — the macOS SVG\nvariants) worked live but the image vanished on every full refresh, even\nthough the store, localStorage and the rendered variant were all correct.\n\nReproduced in a real browser: after reload the <img> reported\ncomplete=true / naturalWidth>0 yet still carried opacity-0. On a refresh\nthe SVG comes from the browser cache and finishes loading before React\nattaches the onLoad handler, so the load event never reaches the\ncomponent, imgLoaded stays false and the fade-in never runs. Picking a\nbackground live always worked because the first fetch is slow enough for\nthe handler to be attached.\n\nCheck the element through a ref after every commit that can swap the src:\nalready-complete images with dimensions are marked loaded immediately, and\ncomplete images with no dimensions are treated as failed so the broken\nimage element is removed.\n\nRegression coverage: cached-image tests for ThemeBackground (mocking\nHTMLImageElement.prototype.complete) plus a store persistence suite that\nsimulates full reloads with vi.resetModules — pick, reload, re-run the\nwrapper mount effect, assert the choice survives across schemes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGA6zC0cqoEvWSjL9uRyrtTVmHl32Wn9MbPKNt/CgSH3lu9nMHsGetL3AGtXvGdZlN\nHDY6lEIZGPVVYhCJRr4gQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_u