comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T17:49:33Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"docs(mcp): document the ./fonts export and theme entry contents\n\nThe quickstart''s Tailwind section described ./theme as tokens-only; it now\nalso carries the component-support CSS, fonts moved to the opt-in ./fonts\nexport, and the @source line is called out as required with its silent\nfailure mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f8bdbe74c81e8df729c2e5c3be26f2d529f009b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/0f8bdbe74c81e8df729c2e5c3be26f2d529f009b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/c3d02c19e7dc4060e596b6a81382b9c47473e90d","verification":{"payload":"tree 0f8bdbe74c81e8df729c2e5c3be26f2d529f009b\nparent 8d1687757af921078f4d01babeb115c750be1296\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785606573 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785606573 -0300\n\ndocs(mcp): document the ./fonts export and theme entry contents\n\nThe quickstart''s Tailwind section described ./theme as tokens-only; it now\nalso carries the component-support CSS, fonts moved to the opt-in ./fonts\nexport, and the @source line is called out as required with its silent\nfailure mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKJFmDcbz5JXkWPxsPzjM6k4VGNAkzpNngWEm8KMc5MOH08vmQWyw3KkDZVmZRQYd4\nShRweHFkdCJQOs5C0o2wk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/us