{"sha":"3f909a11d84b2a6a3e8d89dc64f96b5c10f6ea34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/3f909a11d84b2a6a3e8d89dc64f96b5c10f6ea34"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/a2a44b1f447c4b8210aab0949e90e4313fe8364e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f909a11d84b2a6a3e8d89dc64f96b5c10f6ea34\nparent b0af29dda09bda0a5a55356858b98404c3d30d50\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785606573 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785606573 -0300\n\nfix(docs): drop the nonexistent sidebar-body color row\n\nThe Colors page documented bg-sidebar-body / text-sidebar-body, but no\n--color-sidebar-body token exists anywhere in the theme — the swatch\nrendered transparent and the documented classes generate no CSS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOmDyPNbpA0hDWULj6vh3ISSmP5XSV69Rn/bcvwhVYT/9VKpV5hLBTIKdLoeMwFv+h\nN5I0mj7sSH5eJoWhLxdA4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use