s/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/58425bc113692bced77e2907c26693d8238ab97c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:28:53Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T16:28:53Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(mcp): document BasicTable''s mobile card layout\n\nAgents reading the registry had no way to know rows collapse into cards\nbelow md, so generated code could not opt out of it. Describe the\nbehaviour and show both mobileCards={false} and a custom cardBreakpoint in\nthe example.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"170cfda9a5de74503eac5624fd8e4e8bb7e5e0d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/170cfda9a5de74503eac5624fd8e4e8bb7e5e0d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/58425bc113692bced77e2907c26693d8238ab97c","verification":{"payload":"tree 170cfda9a5de74503eac5624fd8e4e8bb7e5e0d9\nparent 2f58459743500f539c877c0e805b1b7ae2dd1046\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785601733 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785601733 -0300\n\nfix(mcp): document BasicTable''s mobile card layout\n\nAgents reading the registry had no way to know rows collapse into cards\nbelow md, so generated code could not opt out of it. Describe the\nbehaviour and show both mobileCards={false} and a custom cardBreakpoint in\nthe example.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC