2,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/3ef3c5bc6019fb07c2b53775d1e7b50df30041e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:55:32Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:55:32Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"docs(ui): document BasicTable props with TSDoc\n\nEvery BasicTable and TableColumn prop was undocumented, so the docs site''s\nAutoPropsTable rendered an empty Description column and the component had\nno summary at all.\n\nAdded TSDoc for all 13 props, both column-level options and the component\nitself, including an explicit note that BasicTable is standalone and that\nDataTable is the one to reach for when sorting, filtering, pagination or\npinning are needed. Defaults are deliberately not repeated as\n@defaultValue tags — the generator already extracts them from the\ndestructuring defaults, and the tag text leaks into the description.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8b06d67cf6530b3a12e39b119eaabead73627143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/8b06d67cf6530b3a12e39b119eaabead73627143"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/3ef3c5bc6019fb07c2b53775d1e7b50df30041e0","verification":{"payload":"tree 8b06d67cf6530b3a12e39b119eaabead73627143\nparent 7115d82edd39ba8111daf74d537817583599f2e7\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592532 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592532 -0300\n\ndocs(ui): document BasicTable props with TSDoc\n\nEvery BasicTable and TableColumn prop was undocumented, so the docs site''s\nAutoPropsTable rendered an empty Description column and the component had\nno summary at all.\n\nAdded TSDoc for all 13 props, both column-level options and the component\nitself, including an explicit note that BasicTable is standalone and that\nDataTable is the one to reach for when sorting, filtering, pagination or\npinning are needed. Defaults are deliberately not repeated as\n@defaultValue tags — the generator already extracts them from the\ndestructuring defaults, and the tag text leaks into the description.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBNJYPowBfkAN4W3gtYt9MjkTf0ylnwAWNyB28l4Hi6DlwCS5EWlDjBr4maBZ8CnJR\nWOLmaUBJghxbT3W3ultgY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starr