T13:55:13Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(docs): make traffic-light emoji accessible and escape /* in JSX\n\nTahoeWindowSection rendered the traffic-light emoji as bare text, so screen\nreaders announced the raw codepoints; each is now a span with role=\"img\"\nand an aria-label.\n\nMenuItemsGuideSection had a literal `/*` in JSX text, which\nreact/jsx-no-comment-textnodes reads as a stray comment. Wrapped it in an\nexpression container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5ad4ea875f834bf6c37f79a333c0b84e959da27b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/5ad4ea875f834bf6c37f79a333c0b84e959da27b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/7115d82edd39ba8111daf74d537817583599f2e7","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ad4ea875f834bf6c37f79a333c0b84e959da27b\nparent 605b99b04968b5b0ec7a9188c2d6d495d0f1112d\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592513 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592513 -0300\n\nfix(docs): make traffic-light emoji accessible and escape /* in JSX\n\nTahoeWindowSection rendered the traffic-light emoji as bare text, so screen\nreaders announced the raw codepoints; each is now a span with role=\"img\"\nand an aria-label.\n\nMenuItemsGuideSection had a literal `/*` in JSX text, which\nreact/jsx-no-comment-textnodes reads as a stray comment. Wrapped it in an\nexpression container.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQL8P66cpudg4avBEvRuA1oT7Ppi+jBlhEnCGHnO9GOTe+yapLXbzuNOiyuYg0Pp+CN\nVlNuW/ujDEJIhUMKwJ5gY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gi