":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/605b99b04968b5b0ec7a9188c2d6d495d0f1112d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:55:13Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:55:13Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"refactor(ui): tidy the @tanstack/react-table module augmentation\n\nColumnDefBase was declared twice in the same augmentation block; the\nsecond declaration''s members were a strict subset of the first, so\ndeclaration merging made it a no-op. Removed.\n\nColumnMeta''s type parameters are fixed by @tanstack''s own declaration —\nthe arity has to match for the augmentation to merge — but this block does\nnot reference them, so no-unused-vars flagged them. Documented why and\ndisabled the rule on that line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0d66179a2ddd7223542f46a495affe4d7e4722e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/0d66179a2ddd7223542f46a495affe4d7e4722e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/605b99b04968b5b0ec7a9188c2d6d495d0f1112d","verification":{"payload":"tree 0d66179a2ddd7223542f46a495affe4d7e4722e0\nparent af36db700c82a89915282ef78d94078730548c13\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592513 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785592513 -0300\n\nrefactor(ui): tidy the @tanstack/react-table module augmentation\n\nColumnDefBase was declared twice in the same augmentation block; the\nsecond declaration''s members were a strict subset of the first, so\ndeclaration merging made it a no-op. Removed.\n\nColumnMeta''s type parameters are fixed by @tanstack''s own declaration —\nthe arity has to match for the augmentation to merge — but this block does\nnot reference them, so no-unused-vars flagged them. Documented why and\ndisabled the rule on that line.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPuUke0xFuoO8naigPr4J7qdCRHUNNdP+YHYHokfJuPSv7zHFaMPvGo3NpMfasnfjA\nnmfNajUJ6GB8OfUEI0HQM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/605b99b04968b5b0ec7a9188c2d6d495d0f1112d","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKDYwNWI5OWIwNDk2OGI1YjBlYzdhOTE4OGMyZDZkND