:"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/dcbb9f64df23561d30c1180bf296824c94251337/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"test(mcp): allow extra named imports in the DataTable example\n\nThe assertion required the example to contain the exact string\n`import { DataTable }`, but the registry example imports\n`{ DataTable, Button, ListContainer }`. The registry is correct; the\nassertion was stale and had been failing before these changes.\n\nMatch the import with a regex that tolerates additional named imports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b48716da83d48e370af1e05b8973a31b6119de63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/b48716da83d48e370af1e05b8973a31b6119de63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/dcbb9f64df23561d30c1180bf296824c94251337","verification":{"payload":"tree b48716da83d48e370af1e05b8973a31b6119de63\nparent ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\n\ntest(mcp): allow extra named imports in the DataTable example\n\nThe assertion required the example to contain the exact string\n`import { DataTable }`, but the registry example imports\n`{ DataTable, Button, ListContainer }`. The registry is correct; the\nassertion was stale and had been failing before these changes.\n\nMatch the import with a regex that tolerates additional named imports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPpkH3LN6wv9rLlnAhP7AmaXZUL1wE1pZ7qzkujeIVSGirG6fVeDM15yc7kmuNaKGJ\nDFyqgMrTiV6Q0Y/7ICpgU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/dcbb9f64df23561d30c1180bf296824c94251337","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKGRjYmI5ZjY0ZGYyMzU2MWQzMGMxMTgwYmYyOTY4MjRjOTQyNTEzMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0","sha":"ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0"}],"sha":"dcbb9f64df23561d30c1180bf296824c94251337","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/dcbb9f64df23561d30c1180bf296824c94251337"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"refactor(ui): rename useGetCommonPinningStyles to getCommonPinningStyles\n\nThe function calls no hooks — it only derives sticky styles from a column —\nbut the use* prefix made eslint correctly reject the call inside Footer''s\n.map() with react-hooks/rules-of-hooks.\n\nRename it, move it from .tsx to .ts (it had no JSX), and update the three\ncall sites (Footer, TableCell, TableHeader) plus the hooks barrel. The\npublic API is unchanged: useGetCommonPinningStyles stays exported as a\ndeprecated alias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0a4008e430ca40f3746232e7e0ed0ae81bbded68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/0a4008e430ca40f3746232e7e0ed0ae81bbded68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/ae7719ef0c5362dd857b7decc90df378141e0df0","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a4008e430ca40f3746232e7e0ed0ae81bbded68\nparent 01016d397f7b6b13fbc6060592fd1cfa77844db5\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\n\nrefactor(ui): rename useGetCommonPinningStyles to getCommonPinningStyles\n\nThe function calls no hooks — it only derives sticky styles from a column —\nbut the use* prefix made eslint correctly reject the call inside Footer''s\n.map() with react-hooks/rules-of-hooks.\n\nRename it, move it from .tsx to .ts (it had no JSX), and update the three\ncall sites (Footer, TableCell, TableHeader) plus the hooks barrel. The\npublic API is unchanged: useGetCommonPinningStyles stays exported as a\ndeprecated alias.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQCq++TM8sqyDjoEU5p395LXnvpcEpqqZbjJbOq7mJyidj1S6UzRyjhwdzHw8HbJk4i\nDtUCvFMNko0CgWYmXd7gw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_event