ate":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:30Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(scripts): scope each package''s changelog to its own paths\n\ngetCommitsSinceTag ran `git log <tag>..HEAD` without a pathspec, so in this\nmonorepo the MCP changelog absorbed the library''s commits and vice versa.\n\nAdd a per-package `changelogScope` ([''ui/tucu-ui''] and\n[''tools/mcp-server'']) passed through as a pathspec. Checked against\ntucu-ui-v2.7.0..tucu-ui-v2.8.2: 26 unfiltered commits become 13 for the\nlibrary and 3 for the MCP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f4f511e23591948b8b1735692d0dcea01b539424","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/f4f511e23591948b8b1735692d0dcea01b539424"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/01016d397f7b6b13fbc6060592fd1cfa77844db5","verification":{"payload":"tree f4f511e23591948b8b1735692d0dcea01b539424\nparent 8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589890 -0300\n\nfix(scripts): scope each package''s changelog to its own paths\n\ngetCommitsSinceTag ran `git log <tag>..HEAD` without a pathspec, so in this\nmonorepo the MCP changelog absorbed the library''s commits and vice versa.\n\nAdd a per-package `changelogScope` ([''ui/tucu-ui''] and\n[''tools/mcp-server'']) passed through as a pathspec. Checked against\ntucu-ui-v2.7.0..tucu-ui-v2.8.2: 26 unfiltered commits become 13 for the\nlibrary and 3 for the MCP.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1N