owing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:12Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:12Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(mcp): describe BasicTable with its real column API\n\nThe registry entry claimed BasicTable was built on @tanstack/react-table\nand its example used `{ header, accessorKey }`, which is DataTable''s API.\nBasicTable takes `{ key, label, render? }` (see TableColumn in\nui/tucu-ui/src/components/table/basic-table.tsx), so agents querying the\nMCP generated code that did not compile.\n\nRewrite the description and example, and list DataTable under\nrelatedComponents. catalog.ts was already correct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6541df12624a1cff2eae9e388ff74642746a60db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/6541df12624a1cff2eae9e388ff74642746a60db"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72","verification":{"payload":"tree 6541df12624a1cff2eae9e388ff74642746a60db\nparent 6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589872 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589872 -0300\n\nfix(mcp): describe BasicTable with its real column API\n\nThe registry entry claimed BasicTable was built on @tanstack/react-table\nand its example used `{ header, accessorKey }`, which is DataTable''s API.\nBasicTable takes `{ key, label, render? }` (see TableColumn in\nui/tucu-ui/src/components/table/basic-table.tsx), so agents querying the\nMCP generated code that did not compile.\n\nRewrite the description and example, and list DataTable under\nrelatedComponents. catalog.ts was already correct.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQJlQsHt5lDpR+QiYHT6qKmKktjzZoQAId0elRGGrE9oghFMedSFYPaqjmIbL1blgOs\nOxNcD6EPi0swjKYXw5HQQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKDg1MTFiNTIwZjliZTEzNTRlMzNiMTYwZjhlNzJlNTM4NTc3YjBhNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1","sha":"6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1"}],"sha":"8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/8511b520f9be1354e33b160f8e72e538577b0a72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:12Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T13:11:12Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(ui): ship animation styles with the ./theme entry\n\ntheme.css imported neither animations.css nor hero-card.css, and\ncopyThemeCssPlugin did not copy them to dist. Consumers running their own\nTailwind through the `./theme` entry therefore had no keyframes, so the\nHeroCard floating circles never animated.\n\nAdd both @import statements and both files to the copy list. Neither file\npulls in further nested imports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"da0f4340a0ad0ca8a093f833c7fbf40630623cc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/da0f4340a0ad0ca8a093f833c7fbf40630623cc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/6375717b429c1cfe716d98ec3475003d22773ba1","verification":{"payload":"tree da0f4340a0ad0ca8a093f833c7fbf40630623cc0\nparent f7ec9419b3170850267db606dccaff8763761957\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589872 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1785589872 -0300\n\nfix(ui): ship animation styles with the ./theme entry\n\ntheme.css imported neither animations.css nor hero-card.css, and\ncopyThemeCssPlugin did not copy them to dist. Consumers running their own\nTailwind through the `./theme` entry therefore had no keyframes, so the\nHeroCard floating circles never animated.\n\nAdd both @import statements and both files to the copy list. Neither file\npulls in further nested imports.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNMGTUPzWBceh4BW38fkMjI4k529PhhI18OVkyQ6HJWEMETS53cKCvoR3tnZwBbVbo\nk4CAkaR19igeMq2D8njQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T18:36:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/