ers/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/35e8a83df9c59a2cb96a174d49b60dbc0e0ccfe8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:35:46Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:35:46Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(input): stop uncontrolled-to-controlled warning on date picker\n\nInput''s native <input value=...> fell back to the raw (possibly\nundefined) value prop whenever selectedDate was null. Any <Input\ntype=\"date\" /> used without an explicit value/onChange (the documented\nuncontrolled pattern, e.g. bare register()) started as undefined and\nflipped to a defined string the moment a date was picked from the\ncalendar, triggering React''s \"changing an uncontrolled input to be\ncontrolled\" warning. Default to an empty string instead so the value\nis always defined once type is \"date\".","tree":{"sha":"8561ca834be856c1126e6ec3db7eeeb144bf6461","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/8561ca834be856c1126e6ec3db7eeeb144bf6461"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/35e8a83df9c59a2cb96a174d49b60dbc0e0ccfe8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8561ca834be856c1126e6ec3db7eeeb144bf6461\nparent 087a0c214ce60f4ea1aead98bc607718722466f4\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784162146 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784162146 -0300\n\nfix(input): stop uncontrolled-to-controlled warning on date picker\n\nInput''s native <input value=...> fell back to the raw (possibly\nundefined) value prop whenever selectedDate was null. Any <Input\ntype=\"date\" /> used without an explicit value/onChange (the documented\nuncontrolled pattern, e.g. bare register()) started as undefined and\nflipped to a defined string the moment a date was picked from the\ncalendar, triggering React''s \"changing an uncontrolled input to be\ncontrolled\" warning. Default to an empty string instead so the value\nis always defined once type is \"date\".\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQDdBZkYMGo56oT20j8e//bXlbmnCi+TYHscIUiRORiVCFZ2pZkJzfcvxvF2/m2dRLL\nGIAL2umZZ4fLdDLJvTFAc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T00:38:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e