 and\ngenerate_documentation were never documented. generate_page and\ngenerate_chart''s documented input schemas also didn''t match their real\nZod schemas (layout enum, dataShape shape, extra chart options).","tree":{"sha":"22e5788d696caefd6408fefbaeeb875deb838741","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/22e5788d696caefd6408fefbaeeb875deb838741"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/98b57fabff677d8a71c58039c06531f0512ec9dc","verification":{"payload":"tree 22e5788d696caefd6408fefbaeeb875deb838741\nparent a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784160383 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784160383 -0300\n\ndocs: fix stale MCP tool count and schemas on the MCP Server page\n\nThe server actually registers 10 tools (component-tools.ts has 4,\ngeneration-tools.ts has 6), not 7 — search_components, get_props, and\ngenerate_documentation were never documented. generate_page and\ngenerate_chart''s documented input schemas also didn''t match their real\nZod schemas (layout enum, dataShape shape, extra chart options).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQOOzQ4YC1bNRmaBFYYwXT3TudlLcAWpw+ZiUe38gRCCgyQ4zUdmEYtcp0E6nUXpZWo\nRukvBhQCTkJQAmlbMjpAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T00:07:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","