","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:06:16Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-16T00:06:16Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(mcp): sync catalog/quickstart/changelog resources with tucu-ui 2.8.0\n\ncatalog.ts still listed v2.5.0 and react-use (removed in 2.7.3) as a\ndependency, with stale swiper/react-router-dom versions. quickstart.ts\nonly documented the ./styles CSS path, missing the ./theme export and\nOption A/B guidance added in 2.8.0. changelog.ts was missing five\nreleases (2.6.0-2.8.0) entirely.","tree":{"sha":"23ffa0bdab9877fc86cd53197d942cab8055518e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/23ffa0bdab9877fc86cd53197d942cab8055518e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488","verification":{"payload":"tree 23ffa0bdab9877fc86cd53197d942cab8055518e\nparent fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784160376 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784160376 -0300\n\nfix(mcp): sync catalog/quickstart/changelog resources with tucu-ui 2.8.0\n\ncatalog.ts still listed v2.5.0 and react-use (removed in 2.7.3) as a\ndependency, with stale swiper/react-router-dom versions. quickstart.ts\nonly documented the ./styles CSS path, missing the ./theme export and\nOption A/B guidance added in 2.8.0. changelog.ts was missing five\nreleases (2.6.0-2.8.0) entirely.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKVCCBz1bRMlcJUabXovp+w2kgGFWFuUbR2N4KLDIr6Pa2OAOiS9xp77rnWhySXEX3\nWGlDc3ZspG91PtcpJtigc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-16T00:07:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKGEzZmJiNTFkODYwYjg0MDE0N2JhM2E0ZmRmNzQ4NmViMzkxZDU0ODg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b","sha":"fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b"}],"sha":"a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/a3fbb51d860b840147ba3a4fdf7486eb391d5488"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:51:15Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:51:15Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(demo): scan ui/tucu-docs for Tailwind classes too\n\nThe \"Why Choose Tucu UI?\" cards on the Home page (and others across\ntucu-docs) use gradient icon backgrounds (e.g. \"from-purple-500\nvia-purple-600 to-pink-500\") defined only in ui/tucu-docs — a sibling\npackage, not part of @e-burgos/tucu-ui itself. Tailwind''s automatic\ncontent detection picked some of these up inconsistently (monorepo\nsibling directories aren''t reliably covered) and missed others,\nleaving roughly half the cards with a plain background instead of\ntheir gradient.\n\nConfirmed pre-existing and unrelated to the recent ./theme migration:\nreproduces identically with the old `@import ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui/styles''`\nsetup too, and is specific to this internal demo — no external consumer\never ships ui/tucu-docs alongside the published package, so this never\nsurfaces for them. Adding an explicit @source for ui/tucu-docs (the\nsame fix already applied for @e-burgos/tucu-ui''s own node_modules)\nremoves the reliance on automatic detection and fixes all 10 cards.","tree":{"sha":"f35eb949303e2f272a57805042b2537baf24022d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/f35eb949303e2f272a57805042b2537baf24022d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b","verification":{"payload":"tree f35eb949303e2f272a57805042b2537baf24022d\nparent f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784155875 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784155875 -0300\n\nfix(demo): scan ui/tucu-docs for Tailwind classes too\n\nThe \"Why Choose Tucu UI?\" cards on the Home page (and others across\ntucu-docs) use gradient icon backgrounds (e.g. \"from-purple-500\nvia-purple-600 to-pink-500\") defined only in ui/tucu-docs — a sibling\npackage, not part of @e-burgos/tucu-ui itself. Tailwind''s automatic\ncontent detection picked some of these up inconsistently (monorepo\nsibling directories aren''t reliably covered) and missed others,\nleaving roughly half the cards with a plain background instead of\ntheir gradient.\n\nConfirmed pre-existing and unrelated to the recent ./theme migration:\nreproduces identically with the old `@import ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui/styles''`\nsetup too, and is specific to this internal demo — no external consumer\never ships ui/tucu-docs alongside the published package, so this never\nsurfaces for them. Adding an explicit @source for ui/tucu-docs (the\nsame fix already applied for @e-burgos/tucu-ui''s own node_modules)\nremoves the reliance on automatic detection and fixes all 10 cards.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQII6Fpqgi9auSKFTEjM/jNPPfW8H1jUyqHgtJqKp9R6wMkrxeSkscyWBh4Zv37EVoR\n5mzkG797QQwqUMn0Aw+A0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T22:51:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKGZjNDk2YWI5MzI0ZWU1OGZkZGFkYjA4NWJlYzViNGQwZTU4YjJmOWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc","sha":"f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc"}],"sha":"fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/fc496ab9324ee58fddadb085bec5b4d0e58b2f9b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:31:13Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T22:31:13Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"docs: document the ./theme export and fix the Home page''s CSS setup guide\n\nThe Home page''s \"Installing Tailwind CSS (Optional)\" step told users to\n@import ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui/styles'' together with a fresh @import\n''tailwindcss'' — exactly the two-Tailwind-instances anti-pattern the\naudit diagnosed and WS2 fixed. Replaces it with a clear two-path choice:\n\n- Option A (no Tailwind build of your own): ./styles alone, unchanged.\n- Option B (already running Tailwind v4, or need more utilities than\n  Tucu UI uses internally): ''./theme'' + your own Tailwind + @source,\n  with an explicit \"don''t mix the two\" warning.\n\nAlso updates README.md with the same Option B guidance, and switches\napps/demo''s own CSS from the old anti-pattern to Option B — it already\nships its own Tailwind build (tailwindcss + @tailwindcss/vite), so it''s\nthe natural example instance rather than continuing to demonstrate the\npattern the docs now warn against. Verified in the browser: demo renders\nunchanged (home, typography, macOS Sonoma) against the real published\npackage, and the new doc section renders correctly with syntax\nhighlighting and both alert callouts.","tree":{"sha":"d30360c78bbc06b330ea885ba57372f5b3099c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/d30360c78bbc06b330ea885ba57372f5b3099c1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/f5b7b4d1845d10736154dce15d927247034bcadc","verification":{"payload":"tree d30360c78bbc06b330ea885ba57372f5b3099c1a\nparent 67d860d8d16fb8bc7f7505797fa79f32e110e2d6\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784154673 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784154673 -0300\n\ndocs: document the ./theme export and fix the Home page''s CSS setup guide\n\nThe Home page''s \"Installing Tailwind CSS (Optional)\" step told users to\n@import ''@e-burgos/tucu-ui/styles'' together with a fresh @import\n''tailwindcss'' — exactly the two-Tailwind-instances anti-pattern the\naudit diagnosed and WS2 fixed. Replaces it with a clear two-path choice:\n\n- Option A (no Tailwind build of your own): ./styles alone, unchanged.\n- Option B (already running Tailwind v4, or need more utilities than\n  Tucu UI uses internally): ''./theme'' + your own Tailwind + @source,\n  with an explicit \"don''t mix the two\" warning.\n\nAlso updates README.md with the same Option B guidance, and switches\napps/demo''s own CSS from the old anti-pattern to Option B — it already\nships its own Tailwind build (tailwindcss + @tailwindcss/vite), so it''s\nthe natural example instance rather than continuing to demonstrate the\npattern the docs now warn against. Verified in the browser: demo renders\nunchanged (home, typography, macOS Sonoma) against the real published\npackage, and the new doc section renders correctly with syntax\nhighlighting and both alert callouts.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGuGsQFPHRxkBlfX4/H5/8jiJCbYVBjfqJ48GDLXxe40tQN2nm+MXkSe9871Acx9E1\nc2VhkitDCKail