following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/5045327c6d1e2df8bc7c794a2052864d9743ff28/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:12:08Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:12:08Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"refactor(ui): replace react-use with native React implementations\n\nDrops the react-use dependency entirely, along with the CJS/ESM interop\nworkaround it required (unwrapCjsDefault, added in a prior release to\npaper over an esbuild bug when consumers pre-bundle this externalized\ndependency). Removes an entire dependency and that whole class of\nbundler-interop bug at the source instead of working around it.\n\nReimplemented natively, matching react-use''s public API shape so this\nis non-breaking for consumers:\n- useBreakpoint: window.innerWidth + a resize listener\n- useMeasure: ResizeObserver-backed callback ref\n- useClickAway: document mousedown/touchstart listener\n- useCopyToClipboard: navigator.clipboard.writeText with an\n  execCommand fallback for non-secure contexts\n\nAdded dedicated unit tests for all four (previously untested, since\nreact-use''s own implementations were trusted as-is).","tree":{"sha":"a6dbf366bcc25dd3e5f8aafc69a176de1c82249c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/a6dbf366bcc25dd3e5f8aafc69a176de1c82249c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/5045327c6d1e2df8bc7c794a2052864d9743ff28","verification":{"payload":"tree a6dbf366bcc25dd3e5f8aafc69a176de1c82249c\nparent 34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784149928 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784149928 -0300\n\nrefactor(ui): replace react-use with native React implementations\n\nDrops the react-use dependency entirely, along with the CJS/ESM interop\nworkaround it required (unwrapCjsDefault, added in a prior release to\npaper over an esbuild bug when consumers pre-bundle this externalized\ndependency). Removes an entire dependency and that whole class of\nbundler-interop bug at the source instead of working around it.\n\nReimplemented natively, matching react-use''s public API shape so this\nis non-breaking for consumers:\n- useBreakpoint: window.innerWidth + a resize listener\n- useMeasure: ResizeObserver-backed callback ref\n- useClickAway: document mousedown/touchstart listener\n- useCopyToClipboard: navigator.clipboard.writeText with an\n  execCommand fallback for non-secure contexts\n\nAdded dedicated unit tests for all four (previously untested, since\nreact-use''s own implementations were trusted as-is).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQLyC5TaHomjCcjrCaHFMjIR9Kq56Q6CZRmfUzc2IezS0r2QHJ5ZkHGWi6lyEsv/Yy/\n6nG7SAdOi1bhSrAt3k5wo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T21:13:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/5045327c6d1e2df8bc7c794a2052864d9743ff28","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKDUwNDUzMjdjNmQxZTJkZjhiYzdjNzk0YTIwNTI4NjRkOTc0M2ZmMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8","sha":"34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8"}],"sha":"5045327c6d1e2df8bc7c794a2052864d9743ff28","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/5045327c6d1e2df8bc7c794a2052864d9743ff28"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:11:49Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T21:11:49Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(ui): resolve typecheck errors in CodeBlock''s lazy prismjs loading\n\nDynamic import()s for prismjs''s per-language files (e.g. prism-tsx) have\nno type declarations beyond the package root, and @types/prismjs uses\nnamed exports rather than a default export — both went unnoticed because\nthe Rollup build (which doesn''t type-check) still succeeded.\n\nAdd an ambient module declaration for prismjs/components/* and read the\ndynamic import()''s named exports directly instead of destructuring a\nnonexistent .default. Also make the CodeBlock tests async-aware now that\nhighlighting loads lazily, mocking prismjs since its per-language files\nrely on a bare global that Vitest''s Node-based CJS loader can''t resolve\ninside jsdom (verified separately that this works in a real browser).","tree":{"sha":"9453a30621bea76d8bb67ebbf0374a7a19e5ec30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/9453a30621bea76d8bb67ebbf0374a7a19e5ec30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/34c79368ac8dce49e7551040bb6687d9ca0d35c8","verification":{"payload":"tree 9453a30621bea76d8bb67ebbf0374a7a19e5ec30\nparent 225a43a7fc70243e11d6b1a706d0fafcff17b246\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784149909 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784149909 -0300\n\nfix(ui): resolve typecheck errors in CodeBlock''s lazy prismjs loading\n\nDynamic import()s for prismjs''s per-language files (e.g. prism-tsx) have\nno type declarations beyond the package root, and @types/prismjs uses\nnamed exports rather than a default export — both went unnoticed because\nthe Rollup build (which doesn''t type-check) still succeeded.\n\nAdd an ambient module declaration for prismjs/components/* and read the\ndynamic import()''s named exports directly instead of destructuring a\nnonexistent .default. Also make the CodeBlock tests async-aware now that\nhighlighting loads lazily, mocking prismjs since its per-language files\nrely on a bare global that Vitest''s Node-based CJS loader can''t resolve\ninside jsdom (verified separately that this works in a real browser).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQHtp5z60/RTJJOx9+xNA9Anxl/wJjixLXp9qDDLoBpUFuZ1bXfiQJAkteotZxsnZGT\nvSti8uli01kAD3NfdoOQs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T21:13:46Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}",