"date":"2026-07-15T19:55:07Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:55:07Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"chore: release @e-burgos/tucu-ui@2.7.2","tree":{"sha":"69f194c326556dd4e22e9d3999f1724911045df7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/69f194c326556dd4e22e9d3999f1724911045df7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/ec3d00e3bd101c4f569b85cf4a7d46f3929d4450","verification":{"payload":"tree 69f194c326556dd4e22e9d3999f1724911045df7\nparent c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784145307 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784145307 -0300\n\nchore: release @e-burgos/tucu-ui@2.7.2\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQNQXZMjRfGSfE/L1QqcRiMX3+BfrkjIGqUJigeql9oiifwWrZ/Ows3a6V8m4xOucKY\nSxJAqVEOftFRXudmMBmgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T19:55:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/ec3d00e3bd101c4f569b85cf4a7d46f3929d4450","node_id":"C_kwDOMrriatoAKGVjM2QwMGUzYmQxMDFjNGY1NjliODVjZjRhN2Q0NmYzOTI5ZDQ0NTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09","sha":"c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09"}],"sha":"ec3d00e3bd101c4f569b85cf4a7d46f3929d4450","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/ec3d00e3bd101c4f569b85cf4a7d46f3929d4450"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commits/c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:52:57Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-15T19:52:57Z","email":"estebanburgos85@gmail.com","name":"Esteban Burgos"},"message":"fix(ui): lazy-load prismjs in CodeBlock to fix dev-mode crash for consumers\n\nStatic top-level imports of prismjs and its per-language component files\nin CodeBlock get pulled into every consumer''s build via the public barrel\nexport. Vite''s dev-mode dep optimizer evaluates the whole @e-burgos/tucu-ui\npackage eagerly, which throws \"Prism is not defined\" before core sets up\nthe shared Prism object the language files mutate as a global — crashing\nthe app before ThemeProvider can even mount.\n\nLoad prismjs and its language files lazily via dynamic import instead,\nusing literal specifiers (bundler-analyzable) and respecting prismjs''s own\nlanguage dependency graph (tsx needs jsx+typescript, jsx needs\nmarkup+javascript, etc.) since loading a language file before its\ndependency throws too.\n\nVerified against a locally packed tarball installed into apps/demo: app\nrenders, CodeBlock syntax highlighting works with correct token spans, no\nPrism errors.","tree":{"sha":"6dad07665dc0a1d5c61d5e70226ceb6a6d002cc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/trees/6dad07665dc0a1d5c61d5e70226ceb6a6d002cc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/e-burgos/tucu-ui/git/commits/c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09","verification":{"payload":"tree 6dad07665dc0a1d5c61d5e70226ceb6a6d002cc4\nparent e8e7d072f8bc0483465a9388740979d03a1419ea\nauthor Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784145177 -0300\ncommitter Esteban Burgos <estebanburgos85@gmail.com> 1784145177 -0300\n\nfix(ui): lazy-load prismjs in CodeBlock to fix dev-mode crash for consumers\n\nStatic top-level imports of prismjs and its per-language component files\nin CodeBlock get pulled into every consumer''s build via the public barrel\nexport. Vite''s dev-mode dep optimizer evaluates the whole @e-burgos/tucu-ui\npackage eagerly, which throws \"Prism is not defined\" before core sets up\nthe shared Prism object the language files mutate as a global — crashing\nthe app before ThemeProvider can even mount.\n\nLoad prismjs and its language files lazily via dynamic import instead,\nusing literal specifiers (bundler-analyzable) and respecting prismjs''s own\nlanguage dependency graph (tsx needs jsx+typescript, jsx needs\nmarkup+javascript, etc.) since loading a language file before its\ndependency throws too.\n\nVerified against a locally packed tarball installed into apps/demo: app\nrenders, CodeBlock syntax highlighting works with correct token spans, no\nPrism errors.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgW0Xzwxyw7EbDV9DSOn/ap7+0ee\nwK0skFba86dVZgcpQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQGUYQMLgg2ZeU+IiMx4DP451WJxSksl7vZbe0AjuiabAee++QFZs3GgDA/N0q3HhiU\nbBITpV8pf+xN/tyt46HAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-15T19:55:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71472902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos","id":71472902,"login":"e-burgos","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxNDcyOTAy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/e-burgos","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/e-burgos/tucu-ui/commit/c71ae4f3065b4a3f9277382d83f8d9fd02d50d09","node_id":"C_